(1216296, 152888, 23913, '<td valign="top">1st u NEED a CPL the reflection of U is very there in the brass on the brush.....<br/>2nd a smoothe backround would''ve enhanced this shot alot<br/>3rd the prospective makes or breaks this image for me i would like to see the full vase front on or at a diffrent angle it needs to be seen<br/> <br/> <br/>after u make a note of those 1-3, great idea the focus is a tad off and could stand to be better framed but very nice though (the product not so great)<br/> <br/>also for fun u could''ve put it behind a frame from a picture and made it look painted with softish focus would''ve helped to make the backround fit.....<br/> <br/>GL, BC</td>', '1st u NEED a CPL the reflection of U is very there in the brass on the brush.....2nd a smoothe backround would''ve enhanced this shot alot3rd the prospective makes or breaks this image for me i would like to see the full vase front on or at a diffrent angle it needs to be seen  after u make a note of those 1-3, great idea the focus is a tad off and could stand to be better framed but very nice though (the product not so great) also for fun u could''ve put it behind a frame from a picture and made it look painted with softish focus would''ve helped to make the backround fit..... GL, BC', '2005-03-09 00:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
