(1216852, 153523, 26526, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it, so it must be surreal. Hospitality? Or lack of it? (Pineapple) Driven from your home, or the State of Carolina? Or just objects you had sitting around, I am trying to read too much into it? Anyway, I like the photograph, the colors and composition. Great focus also. It is the photo I looked at the longest in this challenge so far, give you an 8.</td>', 'I don''t get it, so it must be surreal. Hospitality? Or lack of it? (Pineapple) Driven from your home, or the State of Carolina? Or just objects you had sitting around, I am trying to read too much into it? Anyway, I like the photograph, the colors and composition. Great focus also. It is the photo I looked at the longest in this challenge so far, give you an 8.', '2005-03-09 04:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
