(1216911, 153638, 29255, '<td valign="top">If you''d have some other composition than having the main subject in the middle, I''m sure this would be even more striking. Nice anyway!</td>', 'If you''d have some other composition than having the main subject in the middle, I''m sure this would be even more striking. Nice anyway!', '2005-03-09 06:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216912, 154138, 33629, '<td valign="top">I love this image!</td>', 'I love this image!', '2005-03-09 06:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216914, 153385, 29255, '<td valign="top">Portraiture well done. Wonder how have you accomplished these colors and borders under basic editing. Nevertheless, the athmosphere is quite surreal and attitude kicks.</td>', 'Portraiture well done. Wonder how have you accomplished these colors and borders under basic editing. Nevertheless, the athmosphere is quite surreal and attitude kicks.', '2005-03-09 06:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216915, 153958, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and marvellous execution. Even the color on the ironing board fits. Well, maybe you could have considered odd clothes on the subject too. Cheerios glares too much, but it might be this unusual monitor I''m using.</td>', 'Nice idea and marvellous execution. Even the color on the ironing board fits. Well, maybe you could have considered odd clothes on the subject too. Cheerios glares too much, but it might be this unusual monitor I''m using.', '2005-03-09 06:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216920, 154067, 29255, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure some other cropping would have been better. Placing the subject in the middle and also the horizon line on the half is questionable as I don''t see anything that would support the image placed in this way.<br/> <br/>Idea is nice and weather suits as well as your exposure, so it''s only about composition, I''d say.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure some other cropping would have been better. Placing the subject in the middle and also the horizon line on the half is questionable as I don''t see anything that would support the image placed in this way. Idea is nice and weather suits as well as your exposure, so it''s only about composition, I''d say.', '2005-03-09 06:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216922, 152872, 29255, '<td valign="top">Snow''s very hard to get well, and here you succeed marvellously. Perhaps you burden the viewer a bit too much by not giving too much hints in the image what''s this all about. I''d definitely critise placement of the most important areas so center. I''d like you to consider if some other cropping or composition would work better.</td>', 'Snow''s very hard to get well, and here you succeed marvellously. Perhaps you burden the viewer a bit too much by not giving too much hints in the image what''s this all about. I''d definitely critise placement of the most important areas so center. I''d like you to consider if some other cropping or composition would work better.', '2005-03-09 06:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216923, 153135, 30392, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is or what''s frustrating about it but I quite like it. 7</td>', 'Not sure what it is or what''s frustrating about it but I quite like it. 7', '2005-03-09 06:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216925, 153918, 29858, '<td valign="top">Wow, one of like 10 people who know what surreal means!!  Very well done, would love to know how you did this!  9</td>', 'Wow, one of like 10 people who know what surreal means!!  Very well done, would love to know how you did this!  9', '2005-03-09 06:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216926, 153765, 29255, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the dogs, but definitely you have most curious subject here. And it does well for the image not to have it taken from shoreline. I wonder if you could have had better lighting however, perhaps waited for couple of hours into afternoon.</td>', 'I can''t see the dogs, but definitely you have most curious subject here. And it does well for the image not to have it taken from shoreline. I wonder if you could have had better lighting however, perhaps waited for couple of hours into afternoon.', '2005-03-09 06:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216929, 152089, 30392, '<td valign="top">This is very good! 10</td>', 'This is very good! 10', '2005-03-09 06:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216933, 152405, 29255, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this one is using curves in extreme settings, but nevertheless a bit boring scene works much better. I''m pretty sure there would be interesting details in the neighbourhood of this place of capture I''d suggest you to concentrate. Also, beware of the small but recognizable objects like the one on bottom right.</td>', 'Perhaps this one is using curves in extreme settings, but nevertheless a bit boring scene works much better. I''m pretty sure there would be interesting details in the neighbourhood of this place of capture I''d suggest you to concentrate. Also, beware of the small but recognizable objects like the one on bottom right.', '2005-03-09 06:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216935, 152089, 33846, '<td valign="top">Very creative. excellent job<br/></td>', 'Very creative. excellent job', '2005-03-09 06:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216936, 154158, 29255, '<td valign="top">Background is nice but the image feels vibrated and soft all over. Perhaps that should have been overdone to bring out the waves out of too well preserved baby. So there''s not too much of surreal left.</td>', 'Background is nice but the image feels vibrated and soft all over. Perhaps that should have been overdone to bring out the waves out of too well preserved baby. So there''s not too much of surreal left.', '2005-03-09 06:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216938, 153724, 29255, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this monitor isn''t well calibrated but there''s no too much to be seen on bottom, which could have been clipped. I might say there''s more than a hint of surreal feeling in the scene, but not too much for me to make it special or even fit the topic.</td>', 'Perhaps this monitor isn''t well calibrated but there''s no too much to be seen on bottom, which could have been clipped. I might say there''s more than a hint of surreal feeling in the scene, but not too much for me to make it special or even fit the topic.', '2005-03-09 06:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216940, 152324, 29255, '<td valign="top">Quite curious use of basic editing for this one. But I have to admit I like the results. The fact there''s three points of interest here, the top flower, the middle center of plant and the bottom red leaf, perhaps tunes this one into higher surreal feeling that it would deserve. Can''t say if the white line on bottom works well or marvellously, but disturbingly nevertheless. White halos are very nice touch. I''d really like to here how did you accomplish this without use of masks etc.</td>', 'Quite curious use of basic editing for this one. But I have to admit I like the results. The fact there''s three points of interest here, the top flower, the middle center of plant and the bottom red leaf, perhaps tunes this one into higher surreal feeling that it would deserve. Can''t say if the white line on bottom works well or marvellously, but disturbingly nevertheless. White halos are very nice touch. I''d really like to here how did you accomplish this without use of masks etc.', '2005-03-09 06:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216941, 153932, 21369, '<td valign="top">fantastic!!  Love it!!</td>', 'fantastic!!  Love it!!', '2005-03-09 06:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216942, 153551, 29255, '<td valign="top">This is definitely one of the best ones. Futuroelectrical surreal feeling is here everywhere.  I especially like the background finishing touch on back and bottom. I have a feeling it would have been better to have something on bottom left corner, but perhaps that raises the surrealness.</td>', 'This is definitely one of the best ones. Futuroelectrical surreal feeling is here everywhere.  I especially like the background finishing touch on back and bottom. I have a feeling it would have been better to have something on bottom left corner, but perhaps that raises the surrealness.', '2005-03-09 06:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216945, 152446, 29255, '<td valign="top">Extremely nice use two flashes in partial scenes. Or perhaps the used technique was something else. Nevertheless the result works. I like the finishing touches like the beer and costum but can''t say like all the object on top of the instrument. Btw. reflection on the bottom right hand side of the piano add up in surreal feeling.</td>', 'Extremely nice use two flashes in partial scenes. Or perhaps the used technique was something else. Nevertheless the result works. I like the finishing touches like the beer and costum but can''t say like all the object on top of the instrument. Btw. reflection on the bottom right hand side of the piano add up in surreal feeling.', '2005-03-09 06:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216946, 154088, 29255, '<td valign="top">The top right corner would have been better done well, but doesn''t hurt the overall image at all. This one is quite surreal. I can''t help thinking the posture of the head would be better in some other angle.</td>', 'The top right corner would have been better done well, but doesn''t hurt the overall image at all. This one is quite surreal. I can''t help thinking the posture of the head would be better in some other angle.', '2005-03-09 06:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216949, 152878, 29255, '<td valign="top">All the best  equipment in the world doesn''t cover up lack of vision. I''m sorry, but doesn''t work for me at all. (Besides, this is technically lousy: objects can hardly be seen and simultaneously the whites glare.)</td>', 'All the best  equipment in the world doesn''t cover up lack of vision. I''m sorry, but doesn''t work for me at all. (Besides, this is technically lousy: objects can hardly be seen and simultaneously the whites glare.)', '2005-03-09 06:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216950, 153847, 29255, '<td valign="top">Curious lighting. Tones are nice. Without the odd eye, this wouldn''t be too surreal. Cropping is quite tight, and background way too present. It comes out quite decent anyway.</td>', 'Curious lighting. Tones are nice. Without the odd eye, this wouldn''t be too surreal. Cropping is quite tight, and background way too present. It comes out quite decent anyway.', '2005-03-09 06:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216952, 153545, 29255, '<td valign="top">Quite odd feeling for a basic edited image, but that''s not bad at all. Humanism in tones  and the posture of the pieces is compelling. Cropping is bit tight in an odd way, but background is horrible and tints to red. Can''t say what this is about, but warm tones make it a pleasurable dream not surreal one.</td>', 'Quite odd feeling for a basic edited image, but that''s not bad at all. Humanism in tones  and the posture of the pieces is compelling. Cropping is bit tight in an odd way, but background is horrible and tints to red. Can''t say what this is about, but warm tones make it a pleasurable dream not surreal one.', '2005-03-09 06:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216954, 152679, 29255, '<td valign="top">The result is compelling, but the exucution is quite lousy. I''d like you to consider a bit how to get the light softer, the color of the towel (maybe even texture of the cloth), the placement of the object between mirrors (would be better much higher) and the need for the borderline of the mirrors. Anyway, you got nice image out of this.</td>', 'The result is compelling, but the exucution is quite lousy. I''d like you to consider a bit how to get the light softer, the color of the towel (maybe even texture of the cloth), the placement of the object between mirrors (would be better much higher) and the need for the borderline of the mirrors. Anyway, you got nice image out of this.', '2005-03-09 06:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216955, 153885, 29255, '<td valign="top">Feels like the border blackness is drawn instead of real. Besides waves the darker line on top of the image makes this more interesting, so I suggest you should have tried to use it in composition. Snow''s very hard to get well, but you accomplish ok. I can''t help having feeling there would have been more to get out of it.</td>', 'Feels like the border blackness is drawn instead of real. Besides waves the darker line on top of the image makes this more interesting, so I suggest you should have tried to use it in composition. Snow''s very hard to get well, but you accomplish ok. I can''t help having feeling there would have been more to get out of it.', '2005-03-09 06:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216958, 154130, 29255, '<td valign="top">Contrast is nice but can''t say if overexposure helped. Idea is well executed. Nice one.</td>', 'Contrast is nice but can''t say if overexposure helped. Idea is well executed. Nice one.', '2005-03-09 06:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216960, 152661, 29255, '<td valign="top">Good results out of use of quite old idea. Nice moment, so that the lines are not broken. Light is perhaps too yellow and the image might be better if you would have put more contrast to it.</td>', 'Good results out of use of quite old idea. Nice moment, so that the lines are not broken. Light is perhaps too yellow and the image might be better if you would have put more contrast to it.', '2005-03-09 06:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216962, 152416, 33145, '<td valign="top">If you are allowed 640px then make it 640 - you are going to always get marked lower for a small shot like this - I can hardly make out any detail which is a shame because on the face of it - it looks like a neat shot.</td>', 'If you are allowed 640px then make it 640 - you are going to always get marked lower for a small shot like this - I can hardly make out any detail which is a shame because on the face of it - it looks like a neat shot.', '2005-03-09 06:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1216963, 152033, 33560, '<td valign="top">Gosh, this is a pretty picture.  Though it has a ''dreamy'' quality it does not have the surrealistic ''unfiltered tap into the subconscious.''  There is nothing bizarre or symbolic or nonsensical.</td>', 'Gosh, this is a pretty picture.  Though it has a ''dreamy'' quality it does not have the surrealistic ''unfiltered tap into the subconscious.''  There is nothing bizarre or symbolic or nonsensical.', '2005-03-09 06:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
