(1216978, 152122, 29255, '<td valign="top">Very nice background but feels like the ball wouldn''t fit by composition or due blurriness. Can''t say. Surreal true. Too tight, perhaps true also, but can''t say if the surreal feeling is lost if it''s widened.</td>', 'Very nice background but feels like the ball wouldn''t fit by composition or due blurriness. Can''t say. Surreal true. Too tight, perhaps true also, but can''t say if the surreal feeling is lost if it''s widened.', '2005-03-09 07:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
