(1217001, 154115, 33560, '<td valign="top">Okay.  This is a really cute snapshot of a really cute baby with a priceless expression.  But as a snapshot, the lighting is very unflattering. I find the vertical edge that cuts through the child''s forhead quite distracting.  And the shot has absolutely nothing to do with the challenge.</td>', 'Okay.  This is a really cute snapshot of a really cute baby with a priceless expression.  But as a snapshot, the lighting is very unflattering. I find the vertical edge that cuts through the child''s forhead quite distracting.  And the shot has absolutely nothing to do with the challenge.', '2005-03-09 07:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
