(1217010, 154143, 33560, '<td valign="top">I happen to really dislike those little ceramic (or is it plastic?) figurines.  Their low production values cheapen everything within about 100 yards.    But here, that seems to be the point of the photo; and I like it. In terms of clearing the ''surrealistic'' hurdle, I think it does, just.  And I like the texture of the fence and the wood behind it.</td>', 'I happen to really dislike those little ceramic (or is it plastic?) figurines.  Their low production values cheapen everything within about 100 yards.    But here, that seems to be the point of the photo; and I like it. In terms of clearing the ''surrealistic'' hurdle, I think it does, just.  And I like the texture of the fence and the wood behind it.', '2005-03-09 07:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217011, 152122, 3569, '<td valign="top">having the twine ball out of focus messes up the image to me</td>', 'having the twine ball out of focus messes up the image to me', '2005-03-09 07:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217014, 152342, 33560, '<td valign="top">A play within a play; a photo within a photo.  I suppose this is sometimes what dreams are made of. It''s a striking photo.  I like the execution of the idea; but it feels a little disconnected to the subconscious.</td>', 'A play within a play; a photo within a photo.  I suppose this is sometimes what dreams are made of. It''s a striking photo.  I like the execution of the idea; but it feels a little disconnected to the subconscious.', '2005-03-09 07:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217015, 152921, 33145, '<td valign="top">the wrapping tape unnecessarily diverts the eye from the glass...</td>', 'the wrapping tape unnecessarily diverts the eye from the glass...', '2005-03-09 07:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217016, 153241, 33145, '<td valign="top">amusing more than surreal - points for making me smile</td>', 'amusing more than surreal - points for making me smile', '2005-03-09 07:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217017, 154017, 7413, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2005-03-09 07:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217018, 153949, 7413, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!</td>', 'Cool idea!', '2005-03-09 07:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217019, 153371, 22459, '<td valign="top">Great idea and has good composition, crisp and clean image that takes you away but I think a bit of color either grass or sky would have given more impact.</td>', 'Great idea and has good composition, crisp and clean image that takes you away but I think a bit of color either grass or sky would have given more impact.', '2005-03-09 07:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217020, 154159, 33560, '<td valign="top">A  simple idea, beautifully wrought.</td>', 'A  simple idea, beautifully wrought.', '2005-03-09 07:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217021, 153982, 9821, '<td valign="top">awesome job, Christina ... you''re shots are many of the reasons i bought myself a fisheye :)  <br/> <br/>//www.pbase.com/shutup/image/40336384<br/></td>', 'awesome job, Christina ... you''re shots are many of the reasons i bought myself a fisheye :)   //www.pbase.com/shutup/image/40336384', '2005-03-09 07:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217022, 152991, 33145, '<td valign="top">looks like too much noise reduction and the color-cast is a bit strong but I give it a 7 for being very surreal</td>', 'looks like too much noise reduction and the color-cast is a bit strong but I give it a 7 for being very surreal', '2005-03-09 07:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217024, 153324, 33560, '<td valign="top">Occasionally I am inclined to give people the benefit of the doubt.  But this photo is so perfect for last week''s Ansel Adam''s challange and so irrellevant to this one, I must score it low. The only thing ''surreal'' about it is that it appears here.  It is a pretty photo and would score reasonably well in some other challenge.</td>', 'Occasionally I am inclined to give people the benefit of the doubt.  But this photo is so perfect for last week''s Ansel Adam''s challange and so irrellevant to this one, I must score it low. The only thing ''surreal'' about it is that it appears here.  It is a pretty photo and would score reasonably well in some other challenge.', '2005-03-09 07:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217027, 153958, 9821, '<td valign="top">well arni ... we''ve all seen it, but that doesn''t make it any less great ... 10</td>', 'well arni ... we''ve all seen it, but that doesn''t make it any less great ... 10', '2005-03-09 07:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217028, 154155, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a sort of ''surrealism for the vegetable patch.''  Clever, pretty. nicely photographed.</td>', 'It''s a sort of ''surrealism for the vegetable patch.''  Clever, pretty. nicely photographed.', '2005-03-09 07:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217029, 153241, 25111, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea but not so well done. I don''t like the skull to the left or the background.</td>', 'This is a great idea but not so well done. I don''t like the skull to the left or the background.', '2005-03-09 07:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217031, 153756, 33145, '<td valign="top">you get a 2 for the DELIGHTFUL pink top.</td>', 'you get a 2 for the DELIGHTFUL pink top.', '2005-03-09 07:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217032, 153948, 9821, '<td valign="top">great to see you competing again, Dave .... awesome shot! ... 10</td>', 'great to see you competing again, Dave .... awesome shot! ... 10', '2005-03-09 07:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217034, 153854, 25111, '<td valign="top">The idea is good. I don''t like the lack of focus and the plant to the right. Also not the prettiest of borders.</td>', 'The idea is good. I don''t like the lack of focus and the plant to the right. Also not the prettiest of borders.', '2005-03-09 07:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217036, 152489, 33145, '<td valign="top">10. A bit ''matrix''-ey but still stunningly surreal. My pick for the Blue.</td>', '10. A bit ''matrix''-ey but still stunningly surreal. My pick for the Blue.', '2005-03-09 07:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217038, 152365, 33379, '<td valign="top">shouldve saved this one for lines</td>', 'shouldve saved this one for lines', '2005-03-09 07:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217039, 154036, 33145, '<td valign="top">9. Beautiful colors, classically surreal. Nice photo - well done.</td>', '9. Beautiful colors, classically surreal. Nice photo - well done.', '2005-03-09 07:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217040, 154103, 33560, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit surprised that I''ve not seen 22 entries like this; it''s the ''obvious'' knockoff choice.  I''ve looked at much of the challenge so far and this is the first.  So you get extra points for copying Magritte and going him one better by using a female as the model.</td>', 'I''m a bit surprised that I''ve not seen 22 entries like this; it''s the ''obvious'' knockoff choice.  I''ve looked at much of the challenge so far and this is the first.  So you get extra points for copying Magritte and going him one better by using a female as the model.', '2005-03-09 07:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217041, 153523, 25111, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I hate the border! The image is quite surreal, but maybe a bit too surreal.</td>', 'Sorry, but I hate the border! The image is quite surreal, but maybe a bit too surreal.', '2005-03-09 07:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217043, 153763, 33145, '<td valign="top">Spooky - fits the challenge really well. 9.</td>', 'Spooky - fits the challenge really well. 9.', '2005-03-09 07:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217044, 154000, 33145, '<td valign="top">Bumped from a 7 to a 9 on closer inspection, more for the skill in capture rather than meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Bumped from a 7 to a 9 on closer inspection, more for the skill in capture rather than meeting the challenge.', '2005-03-09 07:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217046, 152988, 33145, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Love the black and white and the shape. 8</td>', 'Very nice! Love the black and white and the shape. 8', '2005-03-09 07:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217047, 152661, 33560, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love the color and the texture in the photo.  And I like the world turned upside down.  I like how the vertical posts and horizontal rails squiggle in ways reminiscent of some in Dali paintings.  While the photo does not exactly fit in the surrealistic straightjacket I''ve imposed on most photos, I actually like this enough to rate it well.</td>', 'Wow! I love the color and the texture in the photo.  And I like the world turned upside down.  I like how the vertical posts and horizontal rails squiggle in ways reminiscent of some in Dali paintings.  While the photo does not exactly fit in the surrealistic straightjacket I''ve imposed on most photos, I actually like this enough to rate it well.', '2005-03-09 07:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217051, 153893, 33560, '<td valign="top">Don''t get ''Joe Camel'' but I like the flying silver lizard.</td>', 'Don''t get ''Joe Camel'' but I like the flying silver lizard.', '2005-03-09 07:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217055, 153703, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a strong and lovely photo, but it seems completely unrelated to the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a strong and lovely photo, but it seems completely unrelated to the challenge.', '2005-03-09 07:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217056, 153958, 25111, '<td valign="top">Who is it, arnit or babylon? I''m guessing the latter.<br/>The older version is better in my opinion. Brilliant image though.</td>', 'Who is it, arnit or babylon? I''m guessing the latter.The older version is better in my opinion. Brilliant image though.', '2005-03-09 07:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217059, 153371, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice appearance of suspended frame.  Excellent sky.  Who needs to enhance such beautiful clouds.  Don''t know the meaning of boxes to the left of model, but they do provide balance.  The gown is a very nice touch.  An 8.</td>', 'Nice appearance of suspended frame.  Excellent sky.  Who needs to enhance such beautiful clouds.  Don''t know the meaning of boxes to the left of model, but they do provide balance.  The gown is a very nice touch.  An 8.', '2005-03-09 07:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217060, 153535, 22459, '<td valign="top">Holy Christ youv''e got balls, this can''t be real so it meets the challenge .<br/>On an artistic view I think this is great you have broken down the sex barrier and everyone will be LOOKING into this one so you have captured the audience well.<br/>On the downside I would have liked to seen all of the arms and hands but I suppose you have shown everything else so who needs to see hands.<br/> I think you will suffer from all those do gooders and the morale highgrounder who visit  this site and will vote this down but don''t be to worried and keep  your artistic slant on challenges coming.</td>', 'Holy Christ youv''e got balls, this can''t be real so it meets the challenge .On an artistic view I think this is great you have broken down the sex barrier and everyone will be LOOKING into this one so you have captured the audience well.On the downside I would have liked to seen all of the arms and hands but I suppose you have shown everything else so who needs to see hands. I think you will suffer from all those do gooders and the morale highgrounder who visit  this site and will vote this down but don''t be to worried and keep  your artistic slant on challenges coming.', '2005-03-09 07:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217063, 152959, 31282, '<td valign="top">Oh a french title ! :-) Interesting pic.</td>', 'Oh a french title ! :-) Interesting pic.', '2005-03-09 07:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217065, 154076, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the six pointed star light filter.  Nice church and cemetary.   The only negative for me is that the  spirit overstayed and shows little transparencey.  A 7.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the six pointed star light filter.  Nice church and cemetary.   The only negative for me is that the  spirit overstayed and shows little transparencey.  A 7.', '2005-03-09 07:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217068, 153678, 21202, '<td valign="top">I guess I do not understand the intent here.  A figure either approaching or leaving  the glare at the end of a tunnel?  What am I to imagine?  A 4.</td>', 'I guess I do not understand the intent here.  A figure either approaching or leaving  the glare at the end of a tunnel?  What am I to imagine?  A 4.', '2005-03-09 07:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217071, 152289, 22459, '<td valign="top">nice work I thought I was looking at sand dunes.</td>', 'nice work I thought I was looking at sand dunes.', '2005-03-09 07:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217074, 152878, 31282, '<td valign="top">lol ! This deal looks interesting....</td>', 'lol ! This deal looks interesting....', '2005-03-09 07:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217075, 153111, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is a lot closer to surrealism than most of the photos in this competition got.  I like that a graveyard is the backdrop.  And I notice that you''ve placed a brightly lit cross on one of the four ''power spots'' of the photo to echo or balance the placement of the subject'' s ''face.''  I''m afraid that I find the extraeneous elements of the phot really distracting: the chain lin fence, the metal rail fece, and the two giant black stone obelisks sprouting from the phantasm''s shoulder. Finally, this is such a cheery and brightly lit day that the whole ''phantasm'' idea seems, IMO, ridiculous.</td>', 'This is a lot closer to surrealism than most of the photos in this competition got.  I like that a graveyard is the backdrop.  And I notice that you''ve placed a brightly lit cross on one of the four ''power spots'' of the photo to echo or balance the placement of the subject'' s ''face.''  I''m afraid that I find the extraeneous elements of the phot really distracting: the chain lin fence, the metal rail fece, and the two giant black stone obelisks sprouting from the phantasm''s shoulder. Finally, this is such a cheery and brightly lit day that the whole ''phantasm'' idea seems, IMO, ridiculous.', '2005-03-09 07:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217076, 152872, 33379, '<td valign="top">snow?</td>', 'snow?', '2005-03-09 07:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217077, 153880, 22459, '<td valign="top">Good capture with the lighting but I think I would have tried to get the horizan level</td>', 'Good capture with the lighting but I think I would have tried to get the horizan level', '2005-03-09 07:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217078, 153782, 31282, '<td valign="top">loooooooool</td>', 'loooooooool', '2005-03-09 07:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217080, 152047, 21202, '<td valign="top">This looks like it might be a double exposure.  Or, just people caught in a long exposure.  I like the buildings, the highly lit tent and the ghostly lights to the right of the tower.  A 6.</td>', 'This looks like it might be a double exposure.  Or, just people caught in a long exposure.  I like the buildings, the highly lit tent and the ghostly lights to the right of the tower.  A 6.', '2005-03-09 07:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217081, 154051, 33725, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  How did you get the cat to cooperate?</td>', 'Very nice.  How did you get the cat to cooperate?', '2005-03-09 07:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217082, 154049, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very funny!.  It''s a two point snapshot with a very funny plot twist.  Not surreal, but really funny.</td>', 'Very funny!.  It''s a two point snapshot with a very funny plot twist.  Not surreal, but really funny.', '2005-03-09 07:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217086, 153251, 33725, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it better if your two faces on the left weren''t overlapping.  5</td>', 'I would have liked it better if your two faces on the left weren''t overlapping.  5', '2005-03-09 08:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217089, 153535, 21330, '<td valign="top">Gutsy effort! Looks like the divine was a man.<br/></td>', 'Gutsy effort! Looks like the divine was a man.', '2005-03-09 08:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217090, 153877, 33560, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very funny photo.  Except possibly for a person pathologically obsessed with cheese, it is not surreal by the definition applied to the surrealism movement.  But it''s subversive, droll (or do I mean troll)  and nicely photographed.</td>', 'I think this is a very funny photo.  Except possibly for a person pathologically obsessed with cheese, it is not surreal by the definition applied to the surrealism movement.  But it''s subversive, droll (or do I mean troll)  and nicely photographed.', '2005-03-09 08:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217092, 153987, 33725, '<td valign="top">please submit larger images so we can see them</td>', 'please submit larger images so we can see them', '2005-03-09 08:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217094, 152365, 33560, '<td valign="top">What a great entry for the lines challenge!  Or is this a political statement?</td>', 'What a great entry for the lines challenge!  Or is this a political statement?', '2005-03-09 08:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217103, 154093, 21202, '<td valign="top">An interesting point of view.  The brown ceiling support looks like hanging curtains.  The shadows at the top of the stairs work really well, and the  wall really has the appearance of a floor.  Great job.  A 9.</td>', 'An interesting point of view.  The brown ceiling support looks like hanging curtains.  The shadows at the top of the stairs work really well, and the  wall really has the appearance of a floor.  Great job.  A 9.', '2005-03-09 08:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217107, 153727, 33560, '<td valign="top">Definitely in the challenge.  A little politically subversive, perhaps? The strong lighting is both its strong  point and its weakness.  It flatters the background; I love the curtain.   But it both forces blown highlights in all the white materials and huge flat areas of blackness in the dark leather and clothing.  Without these flaws, I think this could be a solid contender for  a top spot.</td>', 'Definitely in the challenge.  A little politically subversive, perhaps? The strong lighting is both its strong  point and its weakness.  It flatters the background; I love the curtain.   But it both forces blown highlights in all the white materials and huge flat areas of blackness in the dark leather and clothing.  Without these flaws, I think this could be a solid contender for  a top spot.', '2005-03-09 08:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217110, 152592, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice simulation of  barren wasteland.  The plate, scepter?, nest, and nest contents are sufficiently strange cohabitants of the wasteland.  The sky and clouds form a perfect backdrop.  A 9.</td>', 'Nice simulation of  barren wasteland.  The plate, scepter?, nest, and nest contents are sufficiently strange cohabitants of the wasteland.  The sky and clouds form a perfect backdrop.  A 9.', '2005-03-09 08:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217112, 154089, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the bright color palette.  This is a cheery, happy, bright, upbeat, straighforward photo with nothing lurking beneath the surface.   I can find nothing that connects it with the challenge.</td>', 'I love the bright color palette.  This is a cheery, happy, bright, upbeat, straighforward photo with nothing lurking beneath the surface.   I can find nothing that connects it with the challenge.', '2005-03-09 08:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217113, 152607, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice backdrop.    Nice candlelizing of the apple.  A 9.</td>', 'Very nice backdrop.    Nice candlelizing of the apple.  A 9.', '2005-03-09 08:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217114, 154000, 33560, '<td valign="top">Ha HA!  Very funny.</td>', 'Ha HA!  Very funny.', '2005-03-09 08:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217115, 154115, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very, Very cute.  A 9.</td>', 'Very, Very cute.  A 9.', '2005-03-09 08:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217116, 152864, 33560, '<td valign="top">Wickedly droll.</td>', 'Wickedly droll.', '2005-03-09 08:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217117, 154020, 30929, '<td valign="top">great concept, I think I am let down a little by a lack visual style / impact (oomph...).<br/> <br/>Great entry however.. well done.</td>', 'great concept, I think I am let down a little by a lack visual style / impact (oomph...). Great entry however.. well done.', '2005-03-09 08:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217120, 153703, 21202, '<td valign="top">Looks like an underexposed picture of the handle of an old tool leaning on a fungus covered wall.  I am sure I am missing the point.  A 4.</td>', 'Looks like an underexposed picture of the handle of an old tool leaning on a fungus covered wall.  I am sure I am missing the point.  A 4.', '2005-03-09 08:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217121, 153162, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much. Taken at ''face'' value, this photo has nothing to do with surrealism - but that''s only so long as a cigar is just a cigar.</td>', 'I like this photo very much. Taken at ''face'' value, this photo has nothing to do with surrealism - but that''s only so long as a cigar is just a cigar.', '2005-03-09 08:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217123, 153880, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice tree.  I like the tilt, lighting, and shadows.  A 7.</td>', 'Very nice tree.  I like the tilt, lighting, and shadows.  A 7.', '2005-03-09 08:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217125, 153602, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love this twist on the Dali portrait.  Everything is perfect except the eyes.  And in a portrait, even a spoof of a surrealistic painting, the eyes are everything.</td>', 'I love this twist on the Dali portrait.  Everything is perfect except the eyes.  And in a portrait, even a spoof of a surrealistic painting, the eyes are everything.', '2005-03-09 08:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217126, 154051, 33560, '<td valign="top">surrealism reinvented.</td>', 'surrealism reinvented.', '2005-03-09 08:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217130, 153185, 9111, '<td valign="top">surreal its not,</td>', 'surreal its not,', '2005-03-09 08:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217131, 153123, 21202, '<td valign="top">The face is very well done, but the overall picture shows demonstrates a number of areas for development of photographic technique.  The shadow of the right shoulder can be lessened by moving the model away from the wall.  The shadow on the lower part of the face mask is a lighting problem as are the shadows in the upper right and the glare in the lower right.  You can quickly master these technique lighting issues.  A 4.</td>', 'The face is very well done, but the overall picture shows demonstrates a number of areas for development of photographic technique.  The shadow of the right shoulder can be lessened by moving the model away from the wall.  The shadow on the lower part of the face mask is a lighting problem as are the shadows in the upper right and the glare in the lower right.  You can quickly master these technique lighting issues.  A 4.', '2005-03-09 08:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217134, 153552, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very good.  A 10.</td>', 'Very good.  A 10.', '2005-03-09 08:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217136, 153993, 21330, '<td valign="top">I think text is not allowed.</td>', 'I think text is not allowed.', '2005-03-09 08:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217137, 153906, 21202, '<td valign="top">I have seen this effect with water flowing, but not fog.  A 9.</td>', 'I have seen this effect with water flowing, but not fog.  A 9.', '2005-03-09 08:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217140, 153772, 9821, '<td valign="top">either this is David''s shot, or you stole his butterflies :) it''s great, nonetheless</td>', 'either this is David''s shot, or you stole his butterflies :) it''s great, nonetheless', '2005-03-09 08:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217141, 152897, 21202, '<td valign="top">Good hiding of your camera .  The sharpening created some halo, but not enough to look like chalk outlines. A 5.</td>', 'Good hiding of your camera .  The sharpening created some halo, but not enough to look like chalk outlines. A 5.', '2005-03-09 08:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217144, 154093, 33560, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it would be a tiny bit more convincing if it had been entitled ''handrail.''  It''s an interesting photo of an interesting place.  Except for the low angle, there is not much hint of the surreal.</td>', 'Perhaps it would be a tiny bit more convincing if it had been entitled ''handrail.''  It''s an interesting photo of an interesting place.  Except for the low angle, there is not much hint of the surreal.', '2005-03-09 08:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217145, 152807, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice pipe.  Great pictorial values.  A10.</td>', 'Nice pipe.  Great pictorial values.  A10.', '2005-03-09 08:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217148, 153765, 33560, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a fun house!  The house may be surreal; the photo, I think, isn''t.</td>', 'Now that''s a fun house!  The house may be surreal; the photo, I think, isn''t.', '2005-03-09 08:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217150, 154102, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very convincing perspective.  A 10.</td>', 'Very convincing perspective.  A 10.', '2005-03-09 08:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
