(1217162, 153846, 33560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The idea of floating stairs is surreal, but the image is not.  Still, I think it just clears the hurdle.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The idea of floating stairs is surreal, but the image is not.  Still, I think it just clears the hurdle.', '2005-03-09 08:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
