(1217183, 153782, 19841, '<td valign="top">This is satire, rather than surrealism, but it IS funny!</td>', 'This is satire, rather than surrealism, but it IS funny!', '2005-03-09 09:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217184, 153860, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the photo.  And several of its points of execution are great; the backwards numbers, the recoil in fear, the ''climbing the wall'' gesture.  IMO, the photo seems burdened by a number of executional flaws.  High key lighting strikes me as the last kind of lighting to use for this kind of a photo, but at least all the other things in the photo are light and pastel.  Except for the belt and shoes. Besides their dark color, the waffle-souled shoes seem too incongruous. <br/> <br/>While we understand that this is a dreamlike experience from the context, the visual language of the photo belies it.  It doesn''t feel dreamlike.   <br/> <br/>Solid effort.  Keep taking photos.</td>', 'I like the idea of the photo.  And several of its points of execution are great; the backwards numbers, the recoil in fear, the ''climbing the wall'' gesture.  IMO, the photo seems burdened by a number of executional flaws.  High key lighting strikes me as the last kind of lighting to use for this kind of a photo, but at least all the other things in the photo are light and pastel.  Except for the belt and shoes. Besides their dark color, the waffle-souled shoes seem too incongruous.  While we understand that this is a dreamlike experience from the context, the visual language of the photo belies it.  It doesn''t feel dreamlike.    Solid effort.  Keep taking photos.', '2005-03-09 09:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
