(1217238, 153985, 33560, '<td valign="top">Kind of mirror''s the ascent of this photo once I made the connection.  It started at 3 and I think it will finish at 6 or 7 on my scorecard.  What I don''t like is that it looks like a photo of a stage set.  And it doesn''t have a strong link to the subconscious, IMO.<br/> <br/>I like that the ladder appears to be underwater powerfully evocing the ''Ascent of Man'' .  It''s very clever, and cleverly photographed.</td>', 'Kind of mirror''s the ascent of this photo once I made the connection.  It started at 3 and I think it will finish at 6 or 7 on my scorecard.  What I don''t like is that it looks like a photo of a stage set.  And it doesn''t have a strong link to the subconscious, IMO. I like that the ladder appears to be underwater powerfully evocing the ''Ascent of Man'' .  It''s very clever, and cleverly photographed.', '2005-03-09 09:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
