(1217245, 153782, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is sooo subversive, sooo funny, sooo over-the-top.  But it is sooo corny, sooo badly lit and wierdly composed.  Kudos for daring to enter it.  It is with considerable regret that I cannot give it more than a 3.</td>', 'This is sooo subversive, sooo funny, sooo over-the-top.  But it is sooo corny, sooo badly lit and wierdly composed.  Kudos for daring to enter it.  It is with considerable regret that I cannot give it more than a 3.', '2005-03-09 09:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
