(1217256, 153763, 14453, '<td valign="top">I would give you 10 for the technique and the idea.  Unfortunately, to my opinion, the picture is not perfect cause you should have give an additionnal artistic touch to the decor and the light on the boys face. Still very surreal and surprising!</td>', 'I would give you 10 for the technique and the idea.  Unfortunately, to my opinion, the picture is not perfect cause you should have give an additionnal artistic touch to the decor and the light on the boys face. Still very surreal and surprising!', '2005-03-09 09:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1217259, 154163, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the coldness, the emptiness.  I like the fact that it seems so lifeless but that the walkway is evidence of habitation.  I guess there is a very subtle ''surreality'' in its existence here. And to give you the benefit of the doubt, Dali''s landscapes shared a similar starkness, though they were dotted with melting clocks.  In all, I think it falls just short of meeting the challenge (which puts it far ahead of more than half the entries.)</td>', 'I like the coldness, the emptiness.  I like the fact that it seems so lifeless but that the walkway is evidence of habitation.  I guess there is a very subtle ''surreality'' in its existence here. And to give you the benefit of the doubt, Dali''s landscapes shared a similar starkness, though they were dotted with melting clocks.  In all, I think it falls just short of meeting the challenge (which puts it far ahead of more than half the entries.)', '2005-03-09 09:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
