(1217371, 152893, 18667, '<td valign="top">very simply... excellent.<br/> <br/>The only thing that I believe draws away from the ''surreal'' aspect are the pinpoints of light in the background.  I think they draw the eye away from the waves a little too much.<br/> <br/>That said, I only give 10''s rarely and I only give them to photos I would be willing to hang on my wall today.  I''d put this on my wall if a print were available.</td>', 'very simply... excellent. The only thing that I believe draws away from the ''surreal'' aspect are the pinpoints of light in the background.  I think they draw the eye away from the waves a little too much. That said, I only give 10''s rarely and I only give them to photos I would be willing to hang on my wall today.  I''d put this on my wall if a print were available.', '2005-03-09 11:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
