(1217461, 152872, 30861, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one and liking it more and more. As landscapes go (and of course this ISN''T a landscape) this one keeps shifting perspectives. I KNOW it''s a reversed shot of a snowdrift, and yet I keep seeing the Hindu Kush or something... I liek it and I give it a 9 just ''cuz it''s different and refreshing and intriguing, even if it''s not really "surreal" by my definition. I hope you do well.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one and liking it more and more. As landscapes go (and of course this ISN''T a landscape) this one keeps shifting perspectives. I KNOW it''s a reversed shot of a snowdrift, and yet I keep seeing the Hindu Kush or something... I liek it and I give it a 9 just ''cuz it''s different and refreshing and intriguing, even if it''s not really "surreal" by my definition. I hope you do well.', '2005-03-09 11:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
