(1217781, 152959, 33435, '<td valign="top">This reminds me more of cubism, or abstract.  Nice shot however.  Actually, the more I look at this, the more I love it.  I want to give this a 10 so bad, but I just don''t think it met the challenge. Hmmm, oh man I''m so undecided.  I hope you won''t be offended if I give this an 8.  You will?  Alright I''ll meet you in the middle with a 9.  ...9...</td>', 'This reminds me more of cubism, or abstract.  Nice shot however.  Actually, the more I look at this, the more I love it.  I want to give this a 10 so bad, but I just don''t think it met the challenge. Hmmm, oh man I''m so undecided.  I hope you won''t be offended if I give this an 8.  You will?  Alright I''ll meet you in the middle with a 9.  ...9...', '2005-03-09 13:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
