(1218287, 152488, 25655, '<td valign="top">I love the look of this photo.<br/>At first I only saw the tree. but something looked weird about it so I stared at it some more. It took me a while to notice the ripples and understand this was a reflection.<br/>the feel and look of this is very surreal to me. Great work! (8)</td>', 'I love the look of this photo.At first I only saw the tree. but something looked weird about it so I stared at it some more. It took me a while to notice the ripples and understand this was a reflection.the feel and look of this is very surreal to me. Great work! (8)', '2005-03-09 17:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218291, 152878, 34779, '<td valign="top">This would fit an irony challenge, or a humour challenge, but it doesn''t seem surreal to me. ON another note, I find the lighting in this suffering a bit. Plus, it''s too much like a display area at a store adn not enough about composing something visually "wow" - 4</td>', 'This would fit an irony challenge, or a humour challenge, but it doesn''t seem surreal to me. ON another note, I find the lighting in this suffering a bit. Plus, it''s too much like a display area at a store adn not enough about composing something visually "wow" - 4', '2005-03-09 17:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
