(1218769, 153958, 17507, '<td valign="top">if this isn''t arnit...</td>', 'if this isn''t arnit...', '2005-03-09 21:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218770, 153063, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot, really great!  But I don''t know what it has to do with surrealism.  Giving it a 7 in any event.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot, really great!  But I don''t know what it has to do with surrealism.  Giving it a 7 in any event.', '2005-03-09 21:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218777, 153967, 17507, '<td valign="top">this picture is definitely extremely weird.</td>', 'this picture is definitely extremely weird.', '2005-03-09 21:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218779, 153324, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice landscape shot, but I guess I don''t see the connection to the challenge topic.</td>', 'This is a very nice landscape shot, but I guess I don''t see the connection to the challenge topic.', '2005-03-09 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218787, 154072, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few photos I think fits the definition of surreal, but unfortunately you''ve got a lot of bright, over-exposed areas, and a lot of noise in the photo that I doubt you intended to be there.</td>', 'This is one of the few photos I think fits the definition of surreal, but unfortunately you''ve got a lot of bright, over-exposed areas, and a lot of noise in the photo that I doubt you intended to be there.', '2005-03-09 22:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218794, 152993, 17103, '<td valign="top">A beautiful abstract; not sure about the connection to surrealism, though.</td>', 'A beautiful abstract; not sure about the connection to surrealism, though.', '2005-03-09 22:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218798, 154020, 26475, '<td valign="top">wow - he must have gotten a really big head rush. LOL.</td>', 'wow - he must have gotten a really big head rush. LOL.', '2005-03-09 22:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218821, 152342, 19841, '<td valign="top">Freaky bizarre!  I''m trying to figure out how you did that.</td>', 'Freaky bizarre!  I''m trying to figure out how you did that.', '2005-03-09 22:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218826, 153371, 17103, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far.  You have the elements of the surreal, and pleasing aesthetics too. 10</td>', 'My favorite so far.  You have the elements of the surreal, and pleasing aesthetics too. 10', '2005-03-09 22:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218835, 153948, 17103, '<td valign="top">One of the best so far.  Very creepy too. :) 10</td>', 'One of the best so far.  Very creepy too. :) 10', '2005-03-09 22:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218847, 152959, 17103, '<td valign="top">My main problem with this photo is I don''t know what I''m looking at.  Maybe reflections of tall buildings?  I thnik in surrealism there should be recognizable objects juxtaposed in an unusual or unexpected way, and I just don''t get that here. 6</td>', 'My main problem with this photo is I don''t know what I''m looking at.  Maybe reflections of tall buildings?  I thnik in surrealism there should be recognizable objects juxtaposed in an unusual or unexpected way, and I just don''t get that here. 6', '2005-03-09 22:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218851, 152437, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool, dreamlike... 8</td>', 'This is pretty cool, dreamlike... 8', '2005-03-09 22:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218862, 153906, 17103, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful landscape, but I don''t think it''s surreal.  7</td>', 'Really beautiful landscape, but I don''t think it''s surreal.  7', '2005-03-09 22:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218866, 152918, 17103, '<td valign="top">Oh my, that''s cruel. :)</td>', 'Oh my, that''s cruel. :)', '2005-03-09 22:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218876, 153982, 17103, '<td valign="top">That is so cool!  Is it done with a fisheye lens? 9</td>', 'That is so cool!  Is it done with a fisheye lens? 9', '2005-03-09 22:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218884, 152783, 20168, '<td valign="top">Magical lighting for this surreal photo!  Cool idea, and excellent technical shot.  Jamm on!</td>', 'Magical lighting for this surreal photo!  Cool idea, and excellent technical shot.  Jamm on!', '2005-03-09 22:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218888, 154133, 17103, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I love the way you got the surface of the moon into the bulb, and the light on your thumb and index finger really looks as if it''s coming from the bulb.  Wow!  How''d you do it? 10</td>', 'Nice!  I love the way you got the surface of the moon into the bulb, and the light on your thumb and index finger really looks as if it''s coming from the bulb.  Wow!  How''d you do it? 10', '2005-03-09 22:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218891, 154165, 20168, '<td valign="top">I love the out of place black &amp; white world of the business chairman among the greens.  Perhaps increasing the saturation would have given this photo even more surreal punch.  One of the best of the lot.</td>', 'I love the out of place black & white world of the business chairman among the greens.  Perhaps increasing the saturation would have given this photo even more surreal punch.  One of the best of the lot.', '2005-03-09 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218903, 153985, 17103, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2005-03-09 22:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218905, 153371, 20168, '<td valign="top">In my estimation, the finest of this challenge, which by artistic-cultural understandings presents very few truly surreal photos.  Your photo presents us with a way through, outside the box, into the beyond, a lovely dreamscape.  Thanks for a great photo.  My favorite to win!  10</td>', 'In my estimation, the finest of this challenge, which by artistic-cultural understandings presents very few truly surreal photos.  Your photo presents us with a way through, outside the box, into the beyond, a lovely dreamscape.  Thanks for a great photo.  My favorite to win!  10', '2005-03-09 22:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218906, 153221, 17103, '<td valign="top">I like this very simple and straightforward presentation. 9</td>', 'I like this very simple and straightforward presentation. 9', '2005-03-09 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218909, 153719, 16829, '<td valign="top">I like the Magritte reference. I wish the background was simpler, ar a bit surreal in its own right. The busyness of branches distracts from the simpicity of your central image.</td>', 'I like the Magritte reference. I wish the background was simpler, ar a bit surreal in its own right. The busyness of branches distracts from the simpicity of your central image.', '2005-03-09 22:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218911, 154148, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great use of realtime photography to capture the essence of surrealism, including the great iconic granddaddy of this misunderstood philosophical-artistic movement.  The woman''s attitude captures the aloof unreality of true surrealism.  I also love the reflective glass panes in this photo. Thanks for bringing surrealism to us without photoshop bastardization.  One of my favorites to ribbon.  10</td>', 'Great use of realtime photography to capture the essence of surrealism, including the great iconic granddaddy of this misunderstood philosophical-artistic movement.  The woman''s attitude captures the aloof unreality of true surrealism.  I also love the reflective glass panes in this photo. Thanks for bringing surrealism to us without photoshop bastardization.  One of my favorites to ribbon.  10', '2005-03-09 22:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218913, 154113, 17103, '<td valign="top">Very nice! 9</td>', 'Very nice! 9', '2005-03-09 22:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218914, 152420, 14735, '<td valign="top">You killed Ducky</td>', 'You killed Ducky', '2005-03-09 22:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218920, 152089, 17103, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! 10</td>', 'Fantastic! 10', '2005-03-09 23:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218922, 153958, 20168, '<td valign="top">The only addition which would have pushed this photo up a notch would be a business suit and ironing a white button down collared shirt.  But I love the ordinary extraordinary surrealism of this work.  If this isn''t Arnit''s work, you owe him a great debt.  Imitation is the sincerest form of flatterly.  Press on Arnit!</td>', 'The only addition which would have pushed this photo up a notch would be a business suit and ironing a white button down collared shirt.  But I love the ordinary extraordinary surrealism of this work.  If this isn''t Arnit''s work, you owe him a great debt.  Imitation is the sincerest form of flatterly.  Press on Arnit!', '2005-03-09 23:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218924, 154154, 17103, '<td valign="top">I can''t even begin to imagine how you accomplished the effect.  Fantastic!</td>', 'I can''t even begin to imagine how you accomplished the effect.  Fantastic!', '2005-03-09 23:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218927, 153892, 32672, '<td valign="top">definetly surreal.  Overexposed, but I think you did so to pull off the effect.  His expression makes the shot--frightened, awed, and fixated.</td>', 'definetly surreal.  Overexposed, but I think you did so to pull off the effect.  His expression makes the shot--frightened, awed, and fixated.', '2005-03-09 23:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218937, 154155, 32672, '<td valign="top">reminds me a bit of an adult Veggietales.</td>', 'reminds me a bit of an adult Veggietales.', '2005-03-09 23:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1218939, 153337, 32672, '<td valign="top">I love how there''s just enough color to put a bit into the cars on the shirt.</td>', 'I love how there''s just enough color to put a bit into the cars on the shirt.', '2005-03-09 23:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
