(1218952, 152129, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image. The leaves give the feeling of something dying and the joint of the arms has the shape of a keyhole. The tape represents supression. Attractive in many ways with daring colors. Good lighting and the tape give it a very modern look. 8</td>', 'A very interesting image. The leaves give the feeling of something dying and the joint of the arms has the shape of a keyhole. The tape represents supression. Attractive in many ways with daring colors. Good lighting and the tape give it a very modern look. 8', '2005-03-09 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
