(1219479, 153638, 32695, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nice picture, this one really caught my eye.  I like the background and then the mountainy land with the snow.  Its neat how there is just a person standing there.  Its a very nice shot</td>', 'Wow! Nice picture, this one really caught my eye.  I like the background and then the mountainy land with the snow.  Its neat how there is just a person standing there.  Its a very nice shot', '2005-03-10 10:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
