(1219491, 152493, 32695, '<td valign="top">This picture really made me laugh when i first saw it!  I love how you put that tiny little boy infront of that huge bookbag! vERY GOOD CREATIVE IDEA.</td>', 'This picture really made me laugh when i first saw it!  I love how you put that tiny little boy infront of that huge bookbag! vERY GOOD CREATIVE IDEA.', '2005-03-10 10:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
