(1220212, 152089, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, executed pretty well. I think it definitely fits the challenge well. I think the simplicity really helps to draw focus to the subjects (I found many entries of good ideas kind of busy, easy to get lost in). I''m not normally a stickler for the "rules" of composition, however in this case I do think that framing the subject to the right, bringing in rot, would make this a stronger shot. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice idea, executed pretty well. I think it definitely fits the challenge well. I think the simplicity really helps to draw focus to the subjects (I found many entries of good ideas kind of busy, easy to get lost in). I''m not normally a stickler for the "rules" of composition, however in this case I do think that framing the subject to the right, bringing in rot, would make this a stronger shot. Nice job.', '2005-03-10 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220223, 154068, 30896, '<td valign="top">amazing. i''m just not sure whether this is not a completely different art style than surrealism.</td>', 'amazing. i''m just not sure whether this is not a completely different art style than surrealism.', '2005-03-10 15:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220232, 154154, 32672, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I try to think of a logical way that this picture could have been created within the rules (I see it''s been validated, so obvoiusly, it''s legit), but I just can''t figure it out.  I hope you planning on sharing with us--I''m very curious!  Wonderful.<br/>It''s almost a bit graint (see pinky, fleshy thumb area of palm), but the wonderment of the image basically outweighs that.</td>', 'Wow.  I try to think of a logical way that this picture could have been created within the rules (I see it''s been validated, so obvoiusly, it''s legit), but I just can''t figure it out.  I hope you planning on sharing with us--I''m very curious!  Wonderful.It''s almost a bit graint (see pinky, fleshy thumb area of palm), but the wonderment of the image basically outweighs that.', '2005-03-10 15:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220253, 154100, 29858, '<td valign="top">Surreal??</td>', 'Surreal??', '2005-03-10 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220271, 153880, 29255, '<td valign="top">I not sure about how I feel this image. For me this is like there''s some idea, but still it doesn''t move on. Tree is odd, and interesting, the boat seems to trigger, but then nothing proceeds. The other shadow disturbs a little, horizon of course. Can''t say what''s wrong but I''m not lead anywhere, sorry.</td>', 'I not sure about how I feel this image. For me this is like there''s some idea, but still it doesn''t move on. Tree is odd, and interesting, the boat seems to trigger, but then nothing proceeds. The other shadow disturbs a little, horizon of course. Can''t say what''s wrong but I''m not lead anywhere, sorry.', '2005-03-10 16:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220274, 152047, 29255, '<td valign="top">What''s surreal here? The athmosphere in general, perhaps the colors of the buildings. The statue for sure! But that''s not the main subject. This image is curious, but doesn''t trigger it for me.</td>', 'What''s surreal here? The athmosphere in general, perhaps the colors of the buildings. The statue for sure! But that''s not the main subject. This image is curious, but doesn''t trigger it for me.', '2005-03-10 16:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220277, 154154, 29858, '<td valign="top">Great Double Exposure.  So few of them seem to work out this well!!!<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Great Double Exposure.  So few of them seem to work out this well!!! 8', '2005-03-10 16:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220279, 152878, 29858, '<td valign="top">I''ll take it!!!  Who do I make the cheque out to???</td>', 'I''ll take it!!!  Who do I make the cheque out to???', '2005-03-10 16:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220281, 153552, 29255, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like this a lot! Perhaps a bit different crop would have been better, clip some right side with the top corner tight area especially. The snow works superbly! Colors are unnatural, a bit like supernatural. Tell me, what''s the filter that produces such effect because the end result is definitely very nice! Also, how is the light so odd, in some places under the branches but not everywhere, and the direction of it seems to alter as well. Very curious, if maybe there''s too much "edited" feel on this. I hope it''s natural!</td>', 'Oh, I like this a lot! Perhaps a bit different crop would have been better, clip some right side with the top corner tight area especially. The snow works superbly! Colors are unnatural, a bit like supernatural. Tell me, what''s the filter that produces such effect because the end result is definitely very nice! Also, how is the light so odd, in some places under the branches but not everywhere, and the direction of it seems to alter as well. Very curious, if maybe there''s too much "edited" feel on this. I hope it''s natural!', '2005-03-10 16:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220282, 152921, 29255, '<td valign="top">I know this needs something besides the bowl, but the trash next to the glass doesn''t work that well.</td>', 'I know this needs something besides the bowl, but the trash next to the glass doesn''t work that well.', '2005-03-10 16:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220284, 153719, 29255, '<td valign="top">One of the many art replicated ideas, but well executed. Even to the point where the objects in front of face feel edited instead of naturally composed.</td>', 'One of the many art replicated ideas, but well executed. Even to the point where the objects in front of face feel edited instead of naturally composed.', '2005-03-10 16:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220286, 154072, 33542, '<td valign="top">Cute. It looks like there is a yellow color cast to the photo, though, that I would have fixed.</td>', 'Cute. It looks like there is a yellow color cast to the photo, though, that I would have fixed.', '2005-03-10 16:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220288, 152783, 29858, '<td valign="top">Just a little blurry on the drums.  Otherwise, very well done.  7</td>', 'Just a little blurry on the drums.  Otherwise, very well done.  7', '2005-03-10 16:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220289, 154150, 29255, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Feels like there''s extra layer of glass between you and the subject, maybe due slight blurriness and unnatural colors with little casting (perhaps too tame greens and too much blue, and maybe too contrasty red). Dunno if this is too surreal, but nice.</td>', 'Very nice. Feels like there''s extra layer of glass between you and the subject, maybe due slight blurriness and unnatural colors with little casting (perhaps too tame greens and too much blue, and maybe too contrasty red). Dunno if this is too surreal, but nice.', '2005-03-10 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220292, 152864, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution. Do you have two images shot, or a window in another? Interesting technique. Nevertheless the idea flies well.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution. Do you have two images shot, or a window in another? Interesting technique. Nevertheless the idea flies well.', '2005-03-10 16:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220293, 154138, 33542, '<td valign="top">Is that a blood stain?!?  :)</td>', 'Is that a blood stain?!?  :)', '2005-03-10 16:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220294, 153260, 33542, '<td valign="top">I don''t really think this is surreal...</td>', 'I don''t really think this is surreal...', '2005-03-10 16:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220297, 152335, 29255, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry. Even though you''ve put some effort to get decent background for this, and lights contrast each other well, and the formation is interesting, I can''t help feeling you recycle fashionable idea once more. However, your execution is much better than I was expecting from the thumbnail, so well done.</td>', 'I''m sorry. Even though you''ve put some effort to get decent background for this, and lights contrast each other well, and the formation is interesting, I can''t help feeling you recycle fashionable idea once more. However, your execution is much better than I was expecting from the thumbnail, so well done.', '2005-03-10 16:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220301, 154112, 33542, '<td valign="top">Finally... a surreal picture!</td>', 'Finally... a surreal picture!', '2005-03-10 16:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220302, 154116, 29255, '<td valign="top">Definitely odd subject. But there''s more of artsy documentary style than I''d like under this contest.</td>', 'Definitely odd subject. But there''s more of artsy documentary style than I''d like under this contest.', '2005-03-10 16:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220308, 152325, 29255, '<td valign="top">Sorry, doesn''t work for me at all. Surely it''s bizarre and in that theme perhaps surreal provided there''s realism here, but this just doesn''t look a nice photo for me.</td>', 'Sorry, doesn''t work for me at all. Surely it''s bizarre and in that theme perhaps surreal provided there''s realism here, but this just doesn''t look a nice photo for me.', '2005-03-10 16:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220310, 153531, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped out the car or whatever is in the top left.</td>', 'I''d have cropped out the car or whatever is in the top left.', '2005-03-10 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220314, 153897, 33542, '<td valign="top">hehe, cute idea</td>', 'hehe, cute idea', '2005-03-10 16:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220319, 154051, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m not thrilled about the wood backdrop - would have prefered a flat painted wall or, even better, a sheet draped from the wall to the floor. Cute idea, though.</td>', 'I''m not thrilled about the wood backdrop - would have prefered a flat painted wall or, even better, a sheet draped from the wall to the floor. Cute idea, though.', '2005-03-10 16:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220325, 153337, 29255, '<td valign="top">Hilarious. This will be well remembered by his or her family.</td>', 'Hilarious. This will be well remembered by his or her family.', '2005-03-10 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220331, 153945, 29858, '<td valign="top">There is something VERY creepy about this photograph.  I don''t know why, but I am very disturbed by this.  And it''s not even from the guy in the dress!!  Hmmm....7</td>', 'There is something VERY creepy about this photograph.  I don''t know why, but I am very disturbed by this.  And it''s not even from the guy in the dress!!  Hmmm....7', '2005-03-10 16:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220334, 153948, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, although it''s fairly clear that you took this picture and then turned it on its side. I was trying to think how you could make it seem more like it was taken in this aspect. One thing you could do is play with the lighting. Also, if you''re using a fast shutter speed you could swing the head and take the picture when the head is "above" the fingers, making it seem when the picture is turned that the head is full of helium and trying to escape or something. Anyway, those were my thoughts  :)</td>', 'I like this a lot, although it''s fairly clear that you took this picture and then turned it on its side. I was trying to think how you could make it seem more like it was taken in this aspect. One thing you could do is play with the lighting. Also, if you''re using a fast shutter speed you could swing the head and take the picture when the head is "above" the fingers, making it seem when the picture is turned that the head is full of helium and trying to escape or something. Anyway, those were my thoughts  :)', '2005-03-10 16:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220338, 153558, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of the coloring of the picture, also there''s a reflection in the glass of the clock that kind of detracts.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of the coloring of the picture, also there''s a reflection in the glass of the clock that kind of detracts.', '2005-03-10 16:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220341, 153241, 29858, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a great shot.  The problem is the distracting background and the flat lighting.  Improving on these aspects would greatly improve the impact.</td>', 'This has the makings of a great shot.  The problem is the distracting background and the flat lighting.  Improving on these aspects would greatly improve the impact.', '2005-03-10 16:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220343, 152807, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I don''t understand the purpose of the greenery.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I don''t understand the purpose of the greenery.', '2005-03-10 16:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220346, 154133, 29255, '<td valign="top">Very nice technique!</td>', 'Very nice technique!', '2005-03-10 16:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
