(1220513, 154128, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I like the way the glass bulb distords the mask slightly. Unfortunatly, i wouldn''t wished for better lighting on the mask itself, as it comes second, and to my opinion, i should''ve came first in the pic. 6</td>', 'Interesting concept. I like the way the glass bulb distords the mask slightly. Unfortunatly, i wouldn''t wished for better lighting on the mask itself, as it comes second, and to my opinion, i should''ve came first in the pic. 6', '2005-03-10 18:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220517, 153558, 25571, '<td valign="top">I honestly do not see anything surreal about this picture. Also, the contrast is way out of proportion, doing wierd artefacts to the shot and some uneasy green splashs.  Having found a way to fit the clock at the place of the actual head would''ve made it a lot better in my opinion. 4</td>', 'I honestly do not see anything surreal about this picture. Also, the contrast is way out of proportion, doing wierd artefacts to the shot and some uneasy green splashs.  Having found a way to fit the clock at the place of the actual head would''ve made it a lot better in my opinion. 4', '2005-03-10 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220519, 152844, 25571, '<td valign="top">I understand the concept of the pic, but do not see it as something extremely surreal...rather mega contrasted and perharps even in negative? This picture doesn''t appeal to me at all, sorry. 3</td>', 'I understand the concept of the pic, but do not see it as something extremely surreal...rather mega contrasted and perharps even in negative? This picture doesn''t appeal to me at all, sorry. 3', '2005-03-10 18:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220520, 153337, 32338, '<td valign="top">Beautiful keepsake baby photo.</td>', 'Beautiful keepsake baby photo.', '2005-03-10 18:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220523, 153162, 25571, '<td valign="top">Ahh finally something original! I really dig the idea behind this shot! Lighting couldn''t been colder tho. The shadow burn on the items is unwelcome to make this shot more ''on white'' perfect. Pretty cool idea mate! 7</td>', 'Ahh finally something original! I really dig the idea behind this shot! Lighting couldn''t been colder tho. The shadow burn on the items is unwelcome to make this shot more ''on white'' perfect. Pretty cool idea mate! 7', '2005-03-10 18:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220524, 154150, 25571, '<td valign="top">I honestly have no idea what is surreal about this... Colours and contrast could''ve been a lot better. Composition is quite dramatic tho. 4</td>', 'I honestly have no idea what is surreal about this... Colours and contrast could''ve been a lot better. Composition is quite dramatic tho. 4', '2005-03-10 18:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220530, 153822, 18834, '<td valign="top">the lighting sems a little strong.  If using a flash, I''d try to diffues it with something such as a coffe filter or wax paper.</td>', 'the lighting sems a little strong.  If using a flash, I''d try to diffues it with something such as a coffe filter or wax paper.', '2005-03-10 18:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220531, 154026, 33421, '<td valign="top">like it maybe a little more color ? 7</td>', 'like it maybe a little more color ? 7', '2005-03-10 18:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220534, 152990, 33942, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but not surrealistic.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but not surrealistic.', '2005-03-10 18:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
