(1220546, 153950, 25571, '<td valign="top">I hardly see anything surreal about this shot. A flying aka thrown banana hardly goes in the right basquet by my opinion. This pic could''ve used a good photoshop overhaul with Auto-Level, Auto-contrast and some colour adjustments. A better crop could''ve help too, as the composition is too wide for such a small subject. 4</td>', 'I hardly see anything surreal about this shot. A flying aka thrown banana hardly goes in the right basquet by my opinion. This pic could''ve used a good photoshop overhaul with Auto-Level, Auto-contrast and some colour adjustments. A better crop could''ve help too, as the composition is too wide for such a small subject. 4', '2005-03-10 18:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220547, 154115, 34835, '<td valign="top">I''m'' just learning some of this stuff myself... but I''m not sure this is at all surreal. Is it because the child''s ears are large?</td>', 'I''m'' just learning some of this stuff myself... but I''m not sure this is at all surreal. Is it because the child''s ears are large?', '2005-03-10 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
