(1220894, 152669, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect and composition. It kind of gives a creepy feel to the whole thing. I love the colour tones and the frame. The ''out of focus'' effect is rather unique and brings a new dimension to the shot.  Unfortunatly, i don''t really underestand what is Surreal about the shot. 6</td>', 'Very nice effect and composition. It kind of gives a creepy feel to the whole thing. I love the colour tones and the frame. The ''out of focus'' effect is rather unique and brings a new dimension to the shot.  Unfortunatly, i don''t really underestand what is Surreal about the shot. 6', '2005-03-10 21:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
