(1220928, 153531, 25571, '<td valign="top">Not liking this picture very much. Composition is wrong, frame is weak. Colours are dull and there is this flare on the upper right which drags away from the dead bird. On top of things, this is not surrealism, its reality.  A good level adjustment in Photoshop would greatly help this picture, followed by a tighter crop to get right of the flare and car bumper. 3</td>', 'Not liking this picture very much. Composition is wrong, frame is weak. Colours are dull and there is this flare on the upper right which drags away from the dead bird. On top of things, this is not surrealism, its reality.  A good level adjustment in Photoshop would greatly help this picture, followed by a tighter crop to get right of the flare and car bumper. 3', '2005-03-10 21:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1220930, 152489, 25571, '<td valign="top">Wow, pretty cool concept here. I like the lighting which is very dramatic. I would''ve wished for a slightly sharper focus (perharps a lower F/stop would''ve helped) and the composition is nice and large, helping the viewer to focus on the subject. Nice idea. 8</td>', 'Wow, pretty cool concept here. I like the lighting which is very dramatic. I would''ve wished for a slightly sharper focus (perharps a lower F/stop would''ve helped) and the composition is nice and large, helping the viewer to focus on the subject. Nice idea. 8', '2005-03-10 21:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
