(1221174, 153918, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done spouting of water from bottle.  The glare off the clock face is obviously a dissapointment to you.  I hope you will correct the lighting and reshoot this. It is an amazing shot.  A 10.</td>', 'Very nicely done spouting of water from bottle.  The glare off the clock face is obviously a dissapointment to you.  I hope you will correct the lighting and reshoot this. It is an amazing shot.  A 10.', '2005-03-11 03:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
