(1221458, 152409, 22748, '<td valign="top">I love the picture, but I don''t think it fits the challenge. In fact, the feeling of the image is more on the super-real side. Regardless, I like the lighting and the dramatic and passionate feel of the image.</td>', 'I love the picture, but I don''t think it fits the challenge. In fact, the feeling of the image is more on the super-real side. Regardless, I like the lighting and the dramatic and passionate feel of the image.', '2005-03-11 10:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221466, 154082, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, I love the intense colors and the smooth texture of the image, but like so many of the images in this challenge, I don''t see surrealism. It would probably do better in a challenge something like "Real Life" or something, obviously the opposite of surrealism.</td>', 'Beautiful image, I love the intense colors and the smooth texture of the image, but like so many of the images in this challenge, I don''t see surrealism. It would probably do better in a challenge something like "Real Life" or something, obviously the opposite of surrealism.', '2005-03-11 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221469, 153892, 22748, '<td valign="top">Eye-catching and outrageous! It''s kind of disturbing, but the very surreal feeling to it makes it less real and disturbing, and more of a fantasy scene.<br/> <br/>This is by FAR the best image so far. It is a beautifully executed image, and it even-GASP-fits the challenge!</td>', 'Eye-catching and outrageous! It''s kind of disturbing, but the very surreal feeling to it makes it less real and disturbing, and more of a fantasy scene. This is by FAR the best image so far. It is a beautifully executed image, and it even-GASP-fits the challenge!', '2005-03-11 10:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221472, 153013, 22748, '<td valign="top">Woohoo! A Mini Cooper! The lighting does make this image feel rather surreal, especially the red and green illumination in the background.</td>', 'Woohoo! A Mini Cooper! The lighting does make this image feel rather surreal, especially the red and green illumination in the background.', '2005-03-11 10:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221473, 153763, 22748, '<td valign="top">Spooky. Good idea and execution.</td>', 'Spooky. Good idea and execution.', '2005-03-11 10:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221475, 153726, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro. I didn''t even notice the reflection at first because I was too busy looking at the eyelash and iris details.</td>', 'Fantastic macro. I didn''t even notice the reflection at first because I was too busy looking at the eyelash and iris details.', '2005-03-11 10:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221476, 154083, 22748, '<td valign="top">Funny, original. Unfortunately, it''s too small, and a little flat as far as lighting and overall contrast goes. Try resizing down to about 640x480 or so for the challenge next time.</td>', 'Funny, original. Unfortunately, it''s too small, and a little flat as far as lighting and overall contrast goes. Try resizing down to about 640x480 or so for the challenge next time.', '2005-03-11 10:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1221484, 152506, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like Neat Image cranked up to 50,000%! I''ve never said this about an entry before, but this looks like the Neat Image is overdone, though I''m sure you''ll hear that from other people. Although it contributes to the surreal feeling a bit, it does some weird things with textures such as in his hair where there are a few distracting sharper pixels, because of the filtration interacting with the texture of the hair.<br/> <br/>It''s a pretty good image though, and it fits the challenge better than most of the entries.</td>', 'Wow, looks like Neat Image cranked up to 50,000%! I''ve never said this about an entry before, but this looks like the Neat Image is overdone, though I''m sure you''ll hear that from other people. Although it contributes to the surreal feeling a bit, it does some weird things with textures such as in his hair where there are a few distracting sharper pixels, because of the filtration interacting with the texture of the hair. It''s a pretty good image though, and it fits the challenge better than most of the entries.', '2005-03-11 10:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
