(1222019, 153727, 25990, '<td valign="top">Great idea to revive and reverse the classic Centaur theme- this horse sure knows how to enjoy life! Technically nearly flawless photo- however, the unidirectional ight seems to bleach the top portion of the frame, it disturbs the elegance of the surrounding and classiness of the subject.  A++ for clear idea, good use of elements and composition.</td>', 'Great idea to revive and reverse the classic Centaur theme- this horse sure knows how to enjoy life! Technically nearly flawless photo- however, the unidirectional ight seems to bleach the top portion of the frame, it disturbs the elegance of the surrounding and classiness of the subject.  A++ for clear idea, good use of elements and composition.', '2005-03-11 16:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
