(1222402, 152409, 31720, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  What would have made it a 9 or 10 for me would have been continuing the theme of mutual completeness.  For example, the man''s head and neck would be disconnected from his arm by the shadow were it not for her arm and upper torso.  Perhaps the area from his shoulder or armpit to his hips so that his legs connect to hers, thus forming one continuous lighted region necessarily composed of both their bodies.<br/> <br/>I think her bra is too distracting an element and breaks up the continuity.<br/> <br/>A solid 8.</td>', 'Great picture.  What would have made it a 9 or 10 for me would have been continuing the theme of mutual completeness.  For example, the man''s head and neck would be disconnected from his arm by the shadow were it not for her arm and upper torso.  Perhaps the area from his shoulder or armpit to his hips so that his legs connect to hers, thus forming one continuous lighted region necessarily composed of both their bodies. I think her bra is too distracting an element and breaks up the continuity. A solid 8.', '2005-03-11 22:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222404, 153337, 18589, '<td valign="top">cute but not surrealistic</td>', 'cute but not surrealistic', '2005-03-11 22:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222407, 154154, 31720, '<td valign="top">You''d better do a write up on how you did this!</td>', 'You''d better do a write up on how you did this!', '2005-03-11 22:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222412, 152335, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a great effect.  I think the light is used here to great advantage. In an abstract challenge this is certainly a high scorer. Bumping up to 6.</td>', 'This is a great effect.  I think the light is used here to great advantage. In an abstract challenge this is certainly a high scorer. Bumping up to 6.', '2005-03-11 22:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222414, 154070, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image whose quality would score very high in an abstract challenge. Bumping to 6 for credit in great rendition.</td>', 'A very nice image whose quality would score very high in an abstract challenge. Bumping to 6 for credit in great rendition.', '2005-03-11 22:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222417, 152878, 22734, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humor and yes the price is defintely surreal. Bumping up to 6.</td>', 'Good sense of humor and yes the price is defintely surreal. Bumping up to 6.', '2005-03-11 22:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222443, 154130, 25571, '<td valign="top">I like the colour and light tone of this picture. It sort of wants to be highkey, but soft at the same time. Unfortunatly, the lighting is a bit too strong and washs everything. I also find the composition a bit off. The background colour (Blue) is has wierd spots in it which is also a turn off. A Frame would probably help this shot and create a claustrophobic effect. A reshoot with more proparation could make some very good material. 5</td>', 'I like the colour and light tone of this picture. It sort of wants to be highkey, but soft at the same time. Unfortunatly, the lighting is a bit too strong and washs everything. I also find the composition a bit off. The background colour (Blue) is has wierd spots in it which is also a turn off. A Frame would probably help this shot and create a claustrophobic effect. A reshoot with more proparation could make some very good material. 5', '2005-03-11 23:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222445, 154154, 25571, '<td valign="top">How This is Surreal! And very well done as well! I would sure like to know how to manage this ''tour de Force'' ! I love the lighting and the composition and position of the hand in the shot. The background is somewhat strange tho, perharps uneven which throws the picture off a little. None The Less a very impressive work! 8!</td>', 'How This is Surreal! And very well done as well! I would sure like to know how to manage this ''tour de Force'' ! I love the lighting and the composition and position of the hand in the shot. The background is somewhat strange tho, perharps uneven which throws the picture off a little. None The Less a very impressive work! 8!', '2005-03-11 23:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222449, 153958, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I''m not too fond of reshoots for challenges, but i must say, this is borderline creepy ;) The composition is very interesting and the DOF makes for a strange atmosphere, which i like very much. I would''ve wished for a tiny bit more sharpness tho. Nice work! 7</td>', 'Interesting idea. I''m not too fond of reshoots for challenges, but i must say, this is borderline creepy ;) The composition is very interesting and the DOF makes for a strange atmosphere, which i like very much. I would''ve wished for a tiny bit more sharpness tho. Nice work! 7', '2005-03-11 23:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222450, 154087, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I like the composition of the shot (square vs diagonal hands). Not too fond on the wierd lighting of the hands, i think it would''ve been better if we could actually see the whole hands. Not sure this represents Surrealism tho.. 4</td>', 'Interesting concept. I like the composition of the shot (square vs diagonal hands). Not too fond on the wierd lighting of the hands, i think it would''ve been better if we could actually see the whole hands. Not sure this represents Surrealism tho.. 4', '2005-03-11 23:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222452, 152418, 25571, '<td valign="top">Quite an Unique shot. Although its been done many times before, i like the approach to it. Lighting on the other hand is very dull and doesn''t give the green stuff any justice. Perharps a warmer setting would''ve helped? Also i believe a frame could do some good here as well. 5</td>', 'Quite an Unique shot. Although its been done many times before, i like the approach to it. Lighting on the other hand is very dull and doesn''t give the green stuff any justice. Perharps a warmer setting would''ve helped? Also i believe a frame could do some good here as well. 5', '2005-03-11 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222453, 154115, 25571, '<td valign="top">I''m not too sure what to do about this shot. It feels like a pocketcamera shot rather then a surrealism challenge submission. 3</td>', 'I''m not too sure what to do about this shot. It feels like a pocketcamera shot rather then a surrealism challenge submission. 3', '2005-03-11 23:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222454, 154158, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, and love the background''s lighting. Unfortunatly i''d wish for more sharpness or focus on the baby''s face. Not really surrealism. 4</td>', 'Interesting angle, and love the background''s lighting. Unfortunatly i''d wish for more sharpness or focus on the baby''s face. Not really surrealism. 4', '2005-03-11 23:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222455, 154093, 25571, '<td valign="top">This is quite interesting. Although the pic doesn''t seem that leveled, this would do well in an Architecture challenge. Colours could be a little warm, or perharps a black and white shot could comunicate better? Not really surrealism...4</td>', 'This is quite interesting. Although the pic doesn''t seem that leveled, this would do well in an Architecture challenge. Colours could be a little warm, or perharps a black and white shot could comunicate better? Not really surrealism...4', '2005-03-11 23:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222456, 153699, 25571, '<td valign="top">Wierd shot. I''m not too fond of the out of focus parts of this shot, as it composes about 80% of the whole picture. Colours are interesting tho, silver and goldish. I''m not sure if this categorises as surrealism tho... 4</td>', 'Wierd shot. I''m not too fond of the out of focus parts of this shot, as it composes about 80% of the whole picture. Colours are interesting tho, silver and goldish. I''m not sure if this categorises as surrealism tho... 4', '2005-03-11 23:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222458, 154017, 25571, '<td valign="top">I''m really enjoying this shot, and i''m not even sure why. I love the colour and the composition. Its very strange and sure feels Surreal or dream-like. If it wasn''t for that little thingy on the lower left... Frame is very nice and works very well in this composition! Well done! 7</td>', 'I''m really enjoying this shot, and i''m not even sure why. I love the colour and the composition. Its very strange and sure feels Surreal or dream-like. If it wasn''t for that little thingy on the lower left... Frame is very nice and works very well in this composition! Well done! 7', '2005-03-11 23:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222459, 152324, 25571, '<td valign="top">Not too fond of this idea. I suppose some could like it and i do not want to lower a score based only on my personal taste. Composition is good tho, but i''d like to see a frame accompany this shot. Doesn''t feel really surreal to me tho... 5</td>', 'Not too fond of this idea. I suppose some could like it and i do not want to lower a score based only on my personal taste. Composition is good tho, but i''d like to see a frame accompany this shot. Doesn''t feel really surreal to me tho... 5', '2005-03-11 23:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222460, 153729, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cool concept. Colours are way to washed out tho. A frame could help this picture as well. Not sure what to make about surrealism in this shot tho. 5</td>', 'Cool concept. Colours are way to washed out tho. A frame could help this picture as well. Not sure what to make about surrealism in this shot tho. 5', '2005-03-11 23:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222461, 153877, 25571, '<td valign="top">hahah Freaky! I must say this is some wierd creature. Definatly more Surreal. i find the DOF a bit wierd, was it done in 2.8? Colours are interesting, but i find this shot lacks a lot of contrast. A frame would probably tighten the whole composition a bit. 6</td>', 'hahah Freaky! I must say this is some wierd creature. Definatly more Surreal. i find the DOF a bit wierd, was it done in 2.8? Colours are interesting, but i find this shot lacks a lot of contrast. A frame would probably tighten the whole composition a bit. 6', '2005-03-11 23:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1222464, 153187, 25571, '<td valign="top">NOw this is very original. What was used for the blood? I love the composition of the shot as its even and you left some room for breath on each sides. Colours are slightly odds tho, as the white burns up on the "table"?. Also the slightly uneven background and different colour throws off my taste for the shot. A frame would do some good here. 7</td>', 'NOw this is very original. What was used for the blood? I love the composition of the shot as its even and you left some room for breath on each sides. Colours are slightly odds tho, as the white burns up on the "table"?. Also the slightly uneven background and different colour throws off my taste for the shot. A frame would do some good here. 7', '2005-03-11 23:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
