(1222661, 153727, 25899, '<td valign="top">Overall, interesting and technically sound shot.<br/>As far as ways to improve the shot, lighting could''ve been more dramatic by making the light from the side instead of the top.<br/>One thing I find weird is that the horse''s hair looks out of focus on the top of the head. Probably because of the lighting making it a little overexposed though.<br/> <br/>Would''ve also been nice to have a lower source of light to see the legs and see a little bit more of the chair''s material since  the leather has a nice texture.<br/> <br/>I think this photo should rate the highest in your submissions and is also one of the few who in my opinion, respects the challenge''s theme.<br/> <br/>Nice job dude!<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Overall, interesting and technically sound shot.As far as ways to improve the shot, lighting could''ve been more dramatic by making the light from the side instead of the top.One thing I find weird is that the horse''s hair looks out of focus on the top of the head. Probably because of the lighting making it a little overexposed though. Would''ve also been nice to have a lower source of light to see the legs and see a little bit more of the chair''s material since  the leather has a nice texture. I think this photo should rate the highest in your submissions and is also one of the few who in my opinion, respects the challenge''s theme. Nice job dude!  ', '2005-03-12 04:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
