(1223143, 152194, 34904, '<td valign="top">Nice composure.</td>', 'Nice composure.', '2005-03-12 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223144, 153173, 34904, '<td valign="top">What are those things at the top?  They look too defined for the rest of the picture.</td>', 'What are those things at the top?  They look too defined for the rest of the picture.', '2005-03-12 12:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223147, 154017, 34904, '<td valign="top">Something I wouldn''t mind hanging over my piano.</td>', 'Something I wouldn''t mind hanging over my piano.', '2005-03-12 12:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223148, 152421, 34904, '<td valign="top">It just looks like your basic rose.</td>', 'It just looks like your basic rose.', '2005-03-12 12:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223149, 152437, 34904, '<td valign="top">A well though out composure with a good dream-like affect.</td>', 'A well though out composure with a good dream-like affect.', '2005-03-12 12:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223154, 154119, 34904, '<td valign="top">Can I type the truth?  It looks good, however my best guess it was a "boo-boo" that was salvaged with the use of filters and adjustments to color and contrast.  Not that it is bad, but I''m not a fan of this type of photo. (basically because I apply this type of affect to my "boo-boos".</td>', 'Can I type the truth?  It looks good, however my best guess it was a "boo-boo" that was salvaged with the use of filters and adjustments to color and contrast.  Not that it is bad, but I''m not a fan of this type of photo. (basically because I apply this type of affect to my "boo-boos".', '2005-03-12 12:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223158, 153996, 34904, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a butt crack.  Interesting.</td>', 'Looks more like a butt crack.  Interesting.', '2005-03-12 12:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223160, 154150, 34904, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but not really surreal.</td>', 'Great photo, but not really surreal.', '2005-03-12 12:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223161, 153948, 34904, '<td valign="top">The distance between the hand ad face add to the drama.  So does the black and white.</td>', 'The distance between the hand ad face add to the drama.  So does the black and white.', '2005-03-12 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223163, 152485, 34904, '<td valign="top">Dramatic.</td>', 'Dramatic.', '2005-03-12 12:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223165, 153847, 34904, '<td valign="top">Great animal photo, but not really surreal.</td>', 'Great animal photo, but not really surreal.', '2005-03-12 12:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223197, 153950, 29557, '<td valign="top">whats w/ the banana?</td>', 'whats w/ the banana?', '2005-03-12 12:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223200, 153324, 29557, '<td valign="top">amazing photo, wrong challenge</td>', 'amazing photo, wrong challenge', '2005-03-12 12:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223201, 154167, 29557, '<td valign="top">funny how hair on someones head is nice and beautiful, but once its off it turns discusting...</td>', 'funny how hair on someones head is nice and beautiful, but once its off it turns discusting...', '2005-03-12 13:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223213, 153251, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, in the two images on the left the eyes are almost lined up but not quite, I think it would look better if they were either separated more or lined up exactly</td>', 'I like the concept, in the two images on the left the eyes are almost lined up but not quite, I think it would look better if they were either separated more or lined up exactly', '2005-03-12 13:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223215, 154054, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but I think the branches get in the way of the main subjects - snow and phone. I''d love to see a similar shot with less in it - just the phone and a snow bank perhaps.</td>', 'I like the idea but I think the branches get in the way of the main subjects - snow and phone. I''d love to see a similar shot with less in it - just the phone and a snow bank perhaps.', '2005-03-12 13:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223226, 153558, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the picture, don''t think it needs the weird processing to add green to arm and body.</td>', 'Like the picture, don''t think it needs the weird processing to add green to arm and body.', '2005-03-12 13:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223235, 154148, 11895, '<td valign="top">how fortunate to find an image of the master, well done</td>', 'how fortunate to find an image of the master, well done', '2005-03-12 13:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223266, 153337, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image and I love how he seems to breathing out bubbles. I don''t think the selective desaturation adds at all in this case because it''s drawing attention to an element of the image that is not the main subject. It might have been fun to keep the bubbles in colour, especially if you had captured the usual rainbow effects in them. 8</td>', 'This is a beautiful image and I love how he seems to breathing out bubbles. I don''t think the selective desaturation adds at all in this case because it''s drawing attention to an element of the image that is not the main subject. It might have been fun to keep the bubbles in colour, especially if you had captured the usual rainbow effects in them. 8', '2005-03-12 13:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223267, 152335, 3087, '<td valign="top">Those sweeping ribbons of blue sit wonderfully over the orange behind. Nice and weird. Shame about dark vertical bar at right side. 8</td>', 'Those sweeping ribbons of blue sit wonderfully over the orange behind. Nice and weird. Shame about dark vertical bar at right side. 8', '2005-03-12 13:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223269, 154040, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever! Shame the print out has such a flat look to it... I wonder if you were further away from the backdrop whether the softer shadow lines would work better? 8</td>', 'Clever! Shame the print out has such a flat look to it... I wonder if you were further away from the backdrop whether the softer shadow lines would work better? 8', '2005-03-12 13:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223272, 154040, 18197, '<td valign="top">Points for humor.</td>', 'Points for humor.', '2005-03-12 13:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223273, 152704, 3087, '<td valign="top">My 2nd favourite in the challenge! Love it! Not so keen on the reflections in his hat and body and the background seems too grey. Still, excellent! 9</td>', 'My 2nd favourite in the challenge! Love it! Not so keen on the reflections in his hat and body and the background seems too grey. Still, excellent! 9', '2005-03-12 13:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223276, 152078, 3087, '<td valign="top">Intriguing - especially the circular lines of texture. Wish I had a clue what those white areas are though I appreciate that in surrealism I don''t need to know...</td>', 'Intriguing - especially the circular lines of texture. Wish I had a clue what those white areas are though I appreciate that in surrealism I don''t need to know...', '2005-03-12 14:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223279, 152991, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the set up as well as the choice of location. Works very well. Lighting doesn''t quite work for me - a little too bright a sky and too dark a "face" and "hands". Lovely idea and colours. 7</td>', 'I love the set up as well as the choice of location. Works very well. Lighting doesn''t quite work for me - a little too bright a sky and too dark a "face" and "hands". Lovely idea and colours. 7', '2005-03-12 14:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223280, 152988, 3087, '<td valign="top">Overall a touch dark (I don''t think it''s my monitor calibration but it could be) but an excellent image. Very intriguing, has a cartoon feel about it. Just want to zoom in and see more detail! 8</td>', 'Overall a touch dark (I don''t think it''s my monitor calibration but it could be) but an excellent image. Very intriguing, has a cartoon feel about it. Just want to zoom in and see more detail! 8', '2005-03-12 14:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223281, 154113, 3087, '<td valign="top">The positioning of the model in the projection is spot on with the head, shirt and tie lighting the forehead and nose but the suit putting the rest of the face in shadow yet still providing catchlights in the eyes. Intriguing, unusual, strange and nicely done! 8</td>', 'The positioning of the model in the projection is spot on with the head, shirt and tie lighting the forehead and nose but the suit putting the rest of the face in shadow yet still providing catchlights in the eyes. Intriguing, unusual, strange and nicely done! 8', '2005-03-12 14:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223283, 154133, 3087, '<td valign="top">My favourite in this challenge. A touch more lighting on the hand would be great. 10</td>', 'My favourite in this challenge. A touch more lighting on the hand would be great. 10', '2005-03-12 14:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223285, 154158, 3087, '<td valign="top">Something utterly bizaare about this one - the perspective distorts the face so unexpectedly. 7</td>', 'Something utterly bizaare about this one - the perspective distorts the face so unexpectedly. 7', '2005-03-12 14:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223286, 152129, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not only is the content fascinating but the composition is really very strong in this one for me. The exact crop at top and bottom, the slight angle and the horizontal placement - all are just spot on. 8</td>', 'Not only is the content fascinating but the composition is really very strong in this one for me. The exact crop at top and bottom, the slight angle and the horizontal placement - all are just spot on. 8', '2005-03-12 14:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223287, 153948, 3087, '<td valign="top">Intriguing and unusual. 8</td>', 'Intriguing and unusual. 8', '2005-03-12 14:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223288, 153897, 3087, '<td valign="top">So simple yet very effective in the strangeness quotient. Like it a lot! 8</td>', 'So simple yet very effective in the strangeness quotient. Like it a lot! 8', '2005-03-12 14:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
