(1223595, 152489, 17203, '<td valign="top">Is that why it''s called the spinal column? That''s certainly surreal- you must not get hugged very often, and I''m guessing you don''t have a waterbed. I''d like to see a bit more space around the head, and less behind... you get the point. ;-)</td>', 'Is that why it''s called the spinal column? That''s certainly surreal- you must not get hugged very often, and I''m guessing you don''t have a waterbed. I''d like to see a bit more space around the head, and less behind... you get the point. ;-)', '2005-03-12 20:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
