(1223607, 154021, 17203, '<td valign="top">Spa-ghetti? Clever idea, somewhat diminished by the uneven lighting. I think this concept could have been stunning with a more traditional-looking (metal) faucet, flowing into a "pool" of other pasta types, with some dishes poking through.  Please don''t forget to take your medication. ;-)</td>', 'Spa-ghetti? Clever idea, somewhat diminished by the uneven lighting. I think this concept could have been stunning with a more traditional-looking (metal) faucet, flowing into a "pool" of other pasta types, with some dishes poking through.  Please don''t forget to take your medication. ;-)', '2005-03-12 20:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223608, 152857, 17203, '<td valign="top">A good, surreal idea (and nice illustration). With better lighting, I think a color version of this might make the top 10.</td>', 'A good, surreal idea (and nice illustration). With better lighting, I think a color version of this might make the top 10.', '2005-03-12 20:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223609, 154100, 17203, '<td valign="top">The contrasting colors are good, but not an especially surreal scene. If you hung strange objects in the tree, that would be more surreal. As is, all the branches form a "messy" image, which rarely scores well.</td>', 'The contrasting colors are good, but not an especially surreal scene. If you hung strange objects in the tree, that would be more surreal. As is, all the branches form a "messy" image, which rarely scores well.', '2005-03-12 20:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223610, 152078, 17203, '<td valign="top">The bizarre distortions are appropriate, but don''t appeal to me personally. The circular lines throughout the image are curious. Some kind of filter?</td>', 'The bizarre distortions are appropriate, but don''t appeal to me personally. The circular lines throughout the image are curious. Some kind of filter?', '2005-03-12 20:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
