(1223694, 153596, 25571, '<td valign="top">The kind of washed colours are interesting in this shot. The composition however is not very interesting as it has many little problems (cut arm, little bit of chair on left...) which makes this pic less then super interesting. Frame is interesting. Doesnt really reflet Surrealim tho. 5</td>', 'The kind of washed colours are interesting in this shot. The composition however is not very interesting as it has many little problems (cut arm, little bit of chair on left...) which makes this pic less then super interesting. Frame is interesting. Doesnt really reflet Surrealim tho. 5', '2005-03-12 21:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223695, 153978, 25571, '<td valign="top">Dig the lighting in this pic. Composition is nice, although it seems the item is a bit offset and i''d wished for a more ''symetric'' shot. Not too sure what to do about it and the theme tho... this ain''t surrealism. 5</td>', 'Dig the lighting in this pic. Composition is nice, although it seems the item is a bit offset and i''d wished for a more ''symetric'' shot. Not too sure what to do about it and the theme tho... this ain''t surrealism. 5', '2005-03-12 21:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223697, 153085, 25571, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. Would''ve wished for a little more sharpness. I also find the moving piece idea very cool, although its not noticable a lot. Not too fond of the composition tho, as i find its a bit lost by the light emanating from the candle. 6</td>', 'Neat idea. Would''ve wished for a little more sharpness. I also find the moving piece idea very cool, although its not noticable a lot. Not too fond of the composition tho, as i find its a bit lost by the light emanating from the candle. 6', '2005-03-12 21:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223699, 153988, 25571, '<td valign="top">Freaky shot. I like the idea, unforutnatly, the lighting is kind of a turnoff for me, as it doesn''t offer any details or contrast of any kind. Also the background is a bit dull (behind fence). Not what i''d call surrealim, but close. 5</td>', 'Freaky shot. I like the idea, unforutnatly, the lighting is kind of a turnoff for me, as it doesn''t offer any details or contrast of any kind. Also the background is a bit dull (behind fence). Not what i''d call surrealim, but close. 5', '2005-03-12 21:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223701, 154072, 25571, '<td valign="top">Now this is wierd! I went ''WHAT THE F***'' when i opened this up, and that tells me you suceeded in surrealism. Unfortunatly, i really don''t like the lighting, which is way too green and takes away from the model of the shot. Also the lighting is too strong and washs the whole set. Composition could''ve been slightly better as well but overall, pretty good. 5</td>', 'Now this is wierd! I went ''WHAT THE F***'' when i opened this up, and that tells me you suceeded in surrealism. Unfortunatly, i really don''t like the lighting, which is way too green and takes away from the model of the shot. Also the lighting is too strong and washs the whole set. Composition could''ve been slightly better as well but overall, pretty good. 5', '2005-03-12 21:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1223703, 152857, 25571, '<td valign="top">Pretty interesting shot. I love the lighting in it, although the clock''s shadow is kind of a turnoff as it doesn''t go well with the rest; kind of breaks the mood (perharps intentionaly?). Composition is nice and sure reflets the envie of Surrealism. Frame is also very important and works quite well. Nice work! 7</td>', 'Pretty interesting shot. I love the lighting in it, although the clock''s shadow is kind of a turnoff as it doesn''t go well with the rest; kind of breaks the mood (perharps intentionaly?). Composition is nice and sure reflets the envie of Surrealism. Frame is also very important and works quite well. Nice work! 7', '2005-03-12 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
