(1224556, 154014, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yikes. A centered, blurry shot of one of the most unappealing subjects possible, with blown highlights, no shadow detail, and questionable white balance. You might have a shot at a ribbon, but I don''t think you''ll like the color. Better luck next time. :-(</td>', 'Yikes. A centered, blurry shot of one of the most unappealing subjects possible, with blown highlights, no shadow detail, and questionable white balance. You might have a shot at a ribbon, but I don''t think you''ll like the color. Better luck next time. :-(', '2005-03-13 14:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
