(1225444, 154039, 34980, '<td valign="top">colorful jigsaw like</td>', 'colorful jigsaw like', '2005-03-14 00:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225457, 153173, 34980, '<td valign="top">scifi effect. good catch</td>', 'scifi effect. good catch', '2005-03-14 00:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225481, 153880, 31889, '<td valign="top">I''d have like this more if you had''ve straightened the horizon.</td>', 'I''d have like this more if you had''ve straightened the horizon.', '2005-03-14 00:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225557, 153727, 31889, '<td valign="top">Ugly shirt .....nice shot :)</td>', 'Ugly shirt .....nice shot :)', '2005-03-14 00:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225601, 153772, 31889, '<td valign="top">Great model...great shot.</td>', 'Great model...great shot.', '2005-03-14 01:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225718, 152049, 25232, '<td valign="top">I love the way you have incorperated the 3d artwork into your phote. Great!</td>', 'I love the way you have incorperated the 3d artwork into your phote. Great!', '2005-03-14 01:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225838, 153023, 21202, '<td valign="top">Extremely nice macro.  The dark lower left corner is certainly surrealistic.  The depth of field is quite low so the focus here was crucial.  Well done.  I think one of the nice things about photography is seeing what is normally overlooked or unseen because of the nature of our vision.  Thank you for allowing  me to see something I never else would have seen.  A 9.</td>', 'Extremely nice macro.  The dark lower left corner is certainly surrealistic.  The depth of field is quite low so the focus here was crucial.  Well done.  I think one of the nice things about photography is seeing what is normally overlooked or unseen because of the nature of our vision.  Thank you for allowing  me to see something I never else would have seen.  A 9.', '2005-03-14 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225844, 153877, 24805, '<td valign="top">incredible. well done. compositionally the large block on the bottom left is distracting to me. it would be better if it were smaller or were less in focus.</td>', 'incredible. well done. compositionally the large block on the bottom left is distracting to me. it would be better if it were smaller or were less in focus.', '2005-03-14 03:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225845, 153599, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.    The reflected "wine bottle "  is not my taste, but the eye itself is magnificent.  I personally would like it if imitating a master were not required for judgement of whether or not a picture is surrealistic.  I hope those who make that the criteria are familiar with the artistic version of this image.  A 9.</td>', 'Nicely done.    The reflected "wine bottle "  is not my taste, but the eye itself is magnificent.  I personally would like it if imitating a master were not required for judgement of whether or not a picture is surrealistic.  I hope those who make that the criteria are familiar with the artistic version of this image.  A 9.', '2005-03-14 03:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225849, 153982, 24805, '<td valign="top">brilliant work. keep it up! i think the grain is good, but i think it''d look better with a bit more "pop" and less brown cast. 9</td>', 'brilliant work. keep it up! i think the grain is good, but i think it''d look better with a bit more "pop" and less brown cast. 9', '2005-03-14 03:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225850, 154051, 21202, '<td valign="top">A nice idea.  The mouse tails unfortunately are rather unmouselike.  Love the cat and cheese.  While the lighting on the cat is adequate it is not quite spectacular nor is the setting.  A 7.</td>', 'A nice idea.  The mouse tails unfortunately are rather unmouselike.  Love the cat and cheese.  While the lighting on the cat is adequate it is not quite spectacular nor is the setting.  A 7.', '2005-03-14 03:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225854, 154154, 24805, '<td valign="top">i really like the concept and the lighting isn''t bad! it does look cloned</td>', 'i really like the concept and the lighting isn''t bad! it does look cloned', '2005-03-14 03:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225856, 154171, 21202, '<td valign="top">This certainly is an emotive shot.  However, the amount of negative space leaves very few pixels for defining the eye.  A 5.</td>', 'This certainly is an emotive shot.  However, the amount of negative space leaves very few pixels for defining the eye.  A 5.', '2005-03-14 03:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225859, 154014, 21202, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, this is just too blurred to be interesting to me.  The colors and tones are nice.  A 3.<br/></td>', 'I am sorry, this is just too blurred to be interesting to me.  The colors and tones are nice.  A 3.', '2005-03-14 03:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225862, 153772, 21202, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting expression.  Good light and nice skin tones.  The butterflies seem to be the cause of the interesting expression.  A 4.</td>', 'Quite an interesting expression.  Good light and nice skin tones.  The butterflies seem to be the cause of the interesting expression.  A 4.', '2005-03-14 03:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225865, 153162, 21202, '<td valign="top">You had a compositional challenge here.  The photo of the lipstick holder and the chili lipstick are excellent.  The bunch of chilis does not work as well as they are partially blocked from view and they are not as brightly lit.  I would suggest just a pair fully exposed and well lit just to the left of the holder.  A 7.</td>', 'You had a compositional challenge here.  The photo of the lipstick holder and the chili lipstick are excellent.  The bunch of chilis does not work as well as they are partially blocked from view and they are not as brightly lit.  I would suggest just a pair fully exposed and well lit just to the left of the holder.  A 7.', '2005-03-14 03:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225869, 153996, 21202, '<td valign="top">This does not look too much like a dune.  However, it is a nice photo of what it is.  A7.</td>', 'This does not look too much like a dune.  However, it is a nice photo of what it is.  A7.', '2005-03-14 03:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225870, 152911, 21202, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I take this to be the real thing.  A swan at takeoff with water drops flying off her wings. But even if I am wrong, an amazing image.  A 10.  I look forward to reading your comments.</td>', 'Wow!  I take this to be the real thing.  A swan at takeoff with water drops flying off her wings. But even if I am wrong, an amazing image.  A 10.  I look forward to reading your comments.', '2005-03-14 03:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225871, 154043, 21202, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice.  The statue is not well photographed against the sky.  The parking lot and its lights do not help.  A 4.</td>', 'The sky is nice.  The statue is not well photographed against the sky.  The parking lot and its lights do not help.  A 4.', '2005-03-14 03:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225873, 152194, 21202, '<td valign="top">This was a very interesting idea.    The lighting provides sparkle for some of the drops but otherwise seems to rob the rose of its color.  I also think it is perhaps a few too many drops.  And the border does not help.  A 4.</td>', 'This was a very interesting idea.    The lighting provides sparkle for some of the drops but otherwise seems to rob the rose of its color.  I also think it is perhaps a few too many drops.  And the border does not help.  A 4.', '2005-03-14 03:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225878, 154113, 32881, '<td valign="top">For surreal photography this is excellent!<br/>THANKS!</td>', 'For surreal photography this is excellent!THANKS!', '2005-03-14 03:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225879, 152487, 21202, '<td valign="top">I had to turn up the brightness on my monitor full scale to see the building as clearly as I  wanted to.  I would have cropped off  at least the lowest boat, even the two lowest boats.   They pull  my eye away from the building and the sky.  A 6.</td>', 'I had to turn up the brightness on my monitor full scale to see the building as clearly as I  wanted to.  I would have cropped off  at least the lowest boat, even the two lowest boats.   They pull  my eye away from the building and the sky.  A 6.', '2005-03-14 03:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225884, 153371, 32881, '<td valign="top">Ah! Thank you. I love the ambiguity...and yet the quiet resolution. You understand surrealism to a profound degree! Well done!</td>', 'Ah! Thank you. I love the ambiguity...and yet the quiet resolution. You understand surrealism to a profound degree! Well done!', '2005-03-14 04:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225886, 154130, 21202, '<td valign="top">Quite a strange arrangement.    Photographically, there is quite a bit of posterization in the blues  The composition might have worked with one "clothes line, but seems overdone with two.  A 5.</td>', 'Quite a strange arrangement.    Photographically, there is quite a bit of posterization in the blues  The composition might have worked with one "clothes line, but seems overdone with two.  A 5.', '2005-03-14 04:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225888, 153794, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photograph.  The lighting makes no astronomical sense, so surrealism is assured.  I will be interested in how you took this shot.  An 8..</td>', 'This is a nice photograph.  The lighting makes no astronomical sense, so surrealism is assured.  I will be interested in how you took this shot.  An 8..', '2005-03-14 04:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225890, 154040, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice pun.  The model is far too close to the background.  I am not too keen of the use of photos in photos.  A 5.</td>', 'Nice pun.  The model is far too close to the background.  I am not too keen of the use of photos in photos.  A 5.', '2005-03-14 04:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225894, 153250, 21202, '<td valign="top">Too much glare off the legs.  Not much beauty.  A 3.</td>', 'Too much glare off the legs.  Not much beauty.  A 3.', '2005-03-14 04:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225897, 154143, 21202, '<td valign="top">The background, though out of focus is very pretty.  The fence is not.  The angel is in between.  A 5.</td>', 'The background, though out of focus is very pretty.  The fence is not.  The angel is in between.  A 5.', '2005-03-14 04:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225901, 152991, 21202, '<td valign="top">After all the work of constructing this sculpture, the photo did not go so well.  I think it is primarily the time of day but their is just too much blur.  A 5, for the sculpture.</td>', 'After all the work of constructing this sculpture, the photo did not go so well.  I think it is primarily the time of day but their is just too much blur.  A 5, for the sculpture.', '2005-03-14 04:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225905, 152493, 21202, '<td valign="top">This backpack situation is getting really bad.  The model is still a little close to the backdrop.  The composition is unusual but it makes its point.  It falls short of doing so artisitically in my opinion.  A 5.</td>', 'This backpack situation is getting really bad.  The model is still a little close to the backdrop.  The composition is unusual but it makes its point.  It falls short of doing so artisitically in my opinion.  A 5.', '2005-03-14 04:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225909, 153846, 21202, '<td valign="top">I turned up the brightness for someone else''s picture.  Fortunately, for this picture as well or all I might  have see was the sunlight on the tops of each stair. But with the brightness up, it is a nice foto with good compositon.  The stairs themeselves are quite wide.  While I do not see anything surreal about this photo, I like it and am giving it a 7 which is what I would have given it if I saw it as surreal.</td>', 'I turned up the brightness for someone else''s picture.  Fortunately, for this picture as well or all I might  have see was the sunlight on the tops of each stair. But with the brightness up, it is a nice foto with good compositon.  The stairs themeselves are quite wide.  While I do not see anything surreal about this photo, I like it and am giving it a 7 which is what I would have given it if I saw it as surreal.', '2005-03-14 04:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225914, 153896, 21202, '<td valign="top">I take it that that is a projected image or a billboard in the background.  The light on the bridge of the nose forms a somewhat strong halo on the sides of the model.  The expression on the model''s face is perfect.  The model is severely underlit in my opinion.  One problem is that there is the reflection of a flash on the woman''s iris which indicates similar lighting for the model.  A 7.</td>', 'I take it that that is a projected image or a billboard in the background.  The light on the bridge of the nose forms a somewhat strong halo on the sides of the model.  The expression on the model''s face is perfect.  The model is severely underlit in my opinion.  One problem is that there is the reflection of a flash on the woman''s iris which indicates similar lighting for the model.  A 7.', '2005-03-14 04:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225915, 153638, 21202, '<td valign="top">Other than the model seemingly frozen in place waiting for her picture to be taken, I find this a very lovely shot and wish I could have been there.  An 8.</td>', 'Other than the model seemingly frozen in place waiting for her picture to be taken, I find this a very lovely shot and wish I could have been there.  An 8.', '2005-03-14 04:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225919, 153982, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great shot.   A lttle more light reflected upward, evien a fill flash would have made this picture perfect for me.  Great sky.  Great lens.  Great models.  An 8.</td>', 'Great shot.   A lttle more light reflected upward, evien a fill flash would have made this picture perfect for me.  Great sky.  Great lens.  Great models.  An 8.', '2005-03-14 04:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225922, 153848, 21202, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting on devil model.  Less so on the other model.  The overall composition is quite good.  I want to give this a 10 because I really like the devil model''s expression and the lighting there, but I am going to limit myself to a 9.  I hope you provide comments on lighting.</td>', 'Excellent lighting on devil model.  Less so on the other model.  The overall composition is quite good.  I want to give this a 10 because I really like the devil model''s expression and the lighting there, but I am going to limit myself to a 9.  I hope you provide comments on lighting.', '2005-03-14 04:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225931, 153958, 21202, '<td valign="top">Now that is just plain silly.  I do like the idea of the use of a teapot for an iron.  The photo quality warrants a 6.  <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Now that is just plain silly.  I do like the idea of the use of a teapot for an iron.  The photo quality warrants a 6.    ', '2005-03-14 04:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225933, 153239, 21202, '<td valign="top">I am afraid that many will claim that this is abstract art rather than surreal.  Nevertheless, I  like the image, and look forward to reading your comments as to how you achieved it.  The title seems a little off.  An 8.</td>', 'I am afraid that many will claim that this is abstract art rather than surreal.  Nevertheless, I  like the image, and look forward to reading your comments as to how you achieved it.  The title seems a little off.  An 8.', '2005-03-14 05:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225936, 153756, 21202, '<td valign="top">The melon and the helmut are nicely lit and photographed.  The frame in the upper left is a major distraction as it the person holding the melon and the helmut.  A 4.</td>', 'The melon and the helmut are nicely lit and photographed.  The frame in the upper left is a major distraction as it the person holding the melon and the helmut.  A 4.', '2005-03-14 05:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225941, 153937, 21202, '<td valign="top">The title does not correspond with the feet.  The splotches on the sidewalk are not very appealing.  A 4.</td>', 'The title does not correspond with the feet.  The splotches on the sidewalk are not very appealing.  A 4.', '2005-03-14 05:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225943, 153726, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like the tree a lot better than the wine bottle.   The mascara might be a little extreme.  A 7.</td>', 'I like the tree a lot better than the wine bottle.   The mascara might be a little extreme.  A 7.', '2005-03-14 05:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225945, 154039, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great title.  It is rather a surrealistic to believe that space time is rooted in something other than the mind of the observer.  Is this a leftover from light on white?  Nice straw bending.  Very nice colors and composition.</td>', 'Great title.  It is rather a surrealistic to believe that space time is rooted in something other than the mind of the observer.  Is this a leftover from light on white?  Nice straw bending.  Very nice colors and composition.', '2005-03-14 05:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225947, 153821, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice positioning and lighting.  This is far more believable than it has any right to be.  A 9.</td>', 'Nice positioning and lighting.  This is far more believable than it has any right to be.  A 9.', '2005-03-14 05:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225948, 153024, 21202, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I think I will go to bed now.  An 8.</td>', 'Well done.  I think I will go to bed now.  An 8.', '2005-03-14 05:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
