(1226374, 152342, 17505, '<td valign="top">This is great. <br/>The colors are perfect and the angles really add interest! <br/>The dust is distracting, but...<br/></td>', 'This is great. The colors are perfect and the angles really add interest! The dust is distracting, but...', '2005-03-14 10:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1226378, 153135, 16557, '<td valign="top">The fact that I dont know exactly what that is forces me to view the work for its color, form and contrast alone. Looks like a painting. I get more emotion and thought out of this picture, versus form and function. Nice.</td>', 'The fact that I dont know exactly what that is forces me to view the work for its color, form and contrast alone. Looks like a painting. I get more emotion and thought out of this picture, versus form and function. Nice.', '2005-03-14 10:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
