(1228349, 152289, 21202, '<td valign="top">Looks more like cars than mars, but I don''t travel that much.  I think I will have to join others in assessing this as abstract rather than surrealistic.  The surrealists for the most part allowed for the easy recognition of their subject matter.  As an abstract, I most find it interesting in terms of how it was done, not from an aesthetic compositional point of view.  A 4.</td>', 'Looks more like cars than mars, but I don''t travel that much.  I think I will have to join others in assessing this as abstract rather than surrealistic.  The surrealists for the most part allowed for the easy recognition of their subject matter.  As an abstract, I most find it interesting in terms of how it was done, not from an aesthetic compositional point of view.  A 4.', '2005-03-15 02:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228352, 153185, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I don''t know if this is a continuation of the Ansel Adams challenge, but I like the composition, the choice of black and white, the tonality (especially the deep black in the horse, and the leisurely life depicted.  A 10.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I don''t know if this is a continuation of the Ansel Adams challenge, but I like the composition, the choice of black and white, the tonality (especially the deep black in the horse, and the leisurely life depicted.  A 10.', '2005-03-15 02:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228353, 153893, 21202, '<td valign="top">Excellent photography and colors.    The glasses are a nice touch.    Good job of getting such a dark background with only basic editing.  An 8.</td>', 'Excellent photography and colors.    The glasses are a nice touch.    Good job of getting such a dark background with only basic editing.  An 8.', '2005-03-15 02:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228357, 152975, 21202, '<td valign="top">I am not too happy with this one.  The thing I liked about surrealism was the attempt to make things that could not be real, profoundly real.    A 4.</td>', 'I am not too happy with this one.  The thing I liked about surrealism was the attempt to make things that could not be real, profoundly real.    A 4.', '2005-03-15 02:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228358, 153617, 21202, '<td valign="top">I agree.  I think this leans to heavily on other art work.  A 4.</td>', 'I agree.  I think this leans to heavily on other art work.  A 4.', '2005-03-15 02:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228361, 153877, 21202, '<td valign="top">Totally bizarre.  I really like the colors and the lighting in this photo.  It leans a little on the  artistic merit of the creator of the little chap.   A 7.</td>', 'Totally bizarre.  I really like the colors and the lighting in this photo.  It leans a little on the  artistic merit of the creator of the little chap.   A 7.', '2005-03-15 02:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228363, 154100, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a nice scene and the red is brought out nicely.  Unfortunately, you are a little too far from the cardinal to make him the star.  A 5.</td>', 'This is a nice scene and the red is brought out nicely.  Unfortunately, you are a little too far from the cardinal to make him the star.  A 5.', '2005-03-15 02:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228364, 153772, 28801, '<td valign="top">Not so surreal but a nice image nevertheless</td>', 'Not so surreal but a nice image nevertheless', '2005-03-15 02:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228365, 153948, 28801, '<td valign="top">Nice use of props</td>', 'Nice use of props', '2005-03-15 02:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228368, 153985, 21202, '<td valign="top">The ladder is spectacular as is the treatment of floor and walls.  I like the reflactions and refractions and the colors.  What this might have to do with Darwin at any age is lost on me.  A 10l</td>', 'The ladder is spectacular as is the treatment of floor and walls.  I like the reflactions and refractions and the colors.  What this might have to do with Darwin at any age is lost on me.  A 10l', '2005-03-15 03:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
