(1228476, 153371, 33145, '<td valign="top">If only there was as much sharpness and contrast in the grass as there is in that cloud on the right I would have given it a 9, but there isn''t so I gave it an 8. Nice shot.</td>', 'If only there was as much sharpness and contrast in the grass as there is in that cloud on the right I would have given it a 9, but there isn''t so I gave it an 8. Nice shot.', '2005-03-15 07:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
