(1228558, 154112, 19943, '<td valign="top">This is probably the most "artsy" photo of the group.  I don''t have many synapses on that side of my brain, so I''m not a good judge for this photo.  However, I do like the setup, and I think that you meet the challenge very well.  good luck.</td>', 'This is probably the most "artsy" photo of the group.  I don''t have many synapses on that side of my brain, so I''m not a good judge for this photo.  However, I do like the setup, and I think that you meet the challenge very well.  good luck.', '2005-03-15 08:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
