(1229486, 153743, 20679, '<td valign="top">yes, but are they surreal? This is such a hard challenge in many ways and the interpretation has been done to death in the forums, but I believe there should be an aspect of "un-realness" in order for it to be different from a regular shot of a tree. Sorry!</td>', 'yes, but are they surreal? This is such a hard challenge in many ways and the interpretation has been done to death in the forums, but I believe there should be an aspect of "un-realness" in order for it to be different from a regular shot of a tree. Sorry!', '2005-03-15 14:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229512, 153260, 20679, '<td valign="top">I''m sure some people are talking about the size of this shot.That doesn''t bother me as it is still pretty clear to me but I''m afraid I don''t thnk there is anything surreal about it. Sorry</td>', 'I''m sure some people are talking about the size of this shot.That doesn''t bother me as it is still pretty clear to me but I''m afraid I don''t thnk there is anything surreal about it. Sorry', '2005-03-15 14:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
