(1229641, 154146, 34192, '<td valign="top">not sure where you were going with this one.  Not sure I can make a helpful comment other than I would probably like it better if the tips of the wings weren''t cut off.</td>', 'not sure where you were going with this one.  Not sure I can make a helpful comment other than I would probably like it better if the tips of the wings weren''t cut off.', '2005-03-15 15:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
