(1229656, 153162, 25041, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea</td>', 'this is a great idea', '2005-03-15 15:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229657, 154050, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very odd.  I guess she is fuzzy due to age?  The caterpilar is cool.  A little out of focus and a little dark.</td>', 'Very odd.  I guess she is fuzzy due to age?  The caterpilar is cool.  A little out of focus and a little dark.', '2005-03-15 15:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229658, 152959, 27845, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract shot. But I don''t think an abstract picture can ever be surreal. Technically, there''s a bit too much going on in your picture. The details are fighting each other. Nice title, it applies well to your image. 5.</td>', 'An interesting abstract shot. But I don''t think an abstract picture can ever be surreal. Technically, there''s a bit too much going on in your picture. The details are fighting each other. Nice title, it applies well to your image. 5.', '2005-03-15 15:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229663, 153984, 27845, '<td valign="top">Too lazy to get off your computer, aren''t you? Your picture is too dark and the contrast is too strong. With different camera settings you might have captured the laser''s glow much better. This doesn''t look very surrealistic to me. 3.</td>', 'Too lazy to get off your computer, aren''t you? Your picture is too dark and the contrast is too strong. With different camera settings you might have captured the laser''s glow much better. This doesn''t look very surrealistic to me. 3.', '2005-03-15 15:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229665, 153187, 34192, '<td valign="top">:) composition, dof, focus all great.  Colors work.  Blood looks too much like ketchup though.  Like the title.</td>', ':) composition, dof, focus all great.  Colors work.  Blood looks too much like ketchup though.  Like the title.', '2005-03-15 15:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229666, 153393, 27845, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, but what is it you think makes it surreal? Everything''s perfectly real in here. A bit more detail in the dark areas would have been nice. 5.</td>', 'A nice picture, but what is it you think makes it surreal? Everything''s perfectly real in here. A bit more detail in the dark areas would have been nice. 5.', '2005-03-15 15:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229669, 154005, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view. colors a little washed. 6</td>', 'Interesting point of view. colors a little washed. 6', '2005-03-15 15:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229672, 152365, 34192, '<td valign="top">wrong challenge?</td>', 'wrong challenge?', '2005-03-15 15:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229674, 153906, 27845, '<td valign="top">It seems you did this without dodging and burning. Good job. I think this would have been much more surreal if the horizon had been cropped off and the image flipped - making it look as if the stones were huge and hanging in the clouded sky.<br/>Anyway, there''s some element in here missing for it to fit the challenge very well. Otherwise it is a great picture and would score high in, say, a b&amp;w contest. 7.</td>', 'It seems you did this without dodging and burning. Good job. I think this would have been much more surreal if the horizon had been cropped off and the image flipped - making it look as if the stones were huge and hanging in the clouded sky.Anyway, there''s some element in here missing for it to fit the challenge very well. Otherwise it is a great picture and would score high in, say, a b&w contest. 7.', '2005-03-15 15:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229676, 152033, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice colour tones. The purple works well. Not very surrealistic to me though. 6.</td>', 'Nice colour tones. The purple works well. Not very surrealistic to me though. 6.', '2005-03-15 15:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229677, 153958, 34192, '<td valign="top">hmmm. Good use of color, focus, DOF.  Really just think the guy is nuts.  But as long as he''s happy!  7</td>', 'hmmm. Good use of color, focus, DOF.  Really just think the guy is nuts.  But as long as he''s happy!  7', '2005-03-15 15:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229680, 153251, 27845, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the two faces on the left. They should either match better (eye on eye) or be further apart. Furthermore, what is surreal about this? 4.</td>', 'I don''t like the two faces on the left. They should either match better (eye on eye) or be further apart. Furthermore, what is surreal about this? 4.', '2005-03-15 15:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229682, 154154, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow. You know how to handle your lighting! Looks great, but as there is still some of the background visible, I''d have chosen something different than bambus. 9.</td>', 'Wow. You know how to handle your lighting! Looks great, but as there is still some of the background visible, I''d have chosen something different than bambus. 9.', '2005-03-15 15:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229684, 153371, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like those wooden boxes. You did a good job on the frame too. Looks as if it were suspended to the womans''s nose. I don''t like the centered horizon. The yellow tone is a bit too saturated. How did you keep it out of the sky? 8.</td>', 'I like those wooden boxes. You did a good job on the frame too. Looks as if it were suspended to the womans''s nose. I don''t like the centered horizon. The yellow tone is a bit too saturated. How did you keep it out of the sky? 8.', '2005-03-15 15:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229687, 153985, 27845, '<td valign="top">Strange. I don''t know which elements of this picture are real and which are painted. Is that ladder really standing there? Bewildering. 7.</td>', 'Strange. I don''t know which elements of this picture are real and which are painted. Is that ladder really standing there? Bewildering. 7.', '2005-03-15 15:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229690, 153137, 27845, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but badly executed. The noise is awful. You shot definatley try to reshoot this picture in brighter light. 6.</td>', 'Great idea, but badly executed. The noise is awful. You shot definatley try to reshoot this picture in brighter light. 6.', '2005-03-15 15:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229698, 153602, 27845, '<td valign="top">Great job on the eyes, it''s almost white. The background is very distracting though. 6.</td>', 'Great job on the eyes, it''s almost white. The background is very distracting though. 6.', '2005-03-15 15:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229700, 152878, 2223, '<td valign="top">*drool</td>', '*drool', '2005-03-15 15:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229703, 153897, 27845, '<td valign="top">Lol. A larger DOF would have been good, it sems the lighting conditions would have allowed a smaller aperture. Sharp clouds would have made the illusion perfect. 7.</td>', 'Lol. A larger DOF would have been good, it sems the lighting conditions would have allowed a smaller aperture. Sharp clouds would have made the illusion perfect. 7.', '2005-03-15 15:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229706, 153743, 34192, '<td valign="top">A little muddled with so much going on.  Focus is excellent, colors okay. 6</td>', 'A little muddled with so much going on.  Focus is excellent, colors okay. 6', '2005-03-15 15:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229711, 152878, 27845, '<td valign="top">It''s a trick! The 20D box is empty! ;) A real shopping window with a better sign would have improved the image a lot. 6.</td>', 'It''s a trick! The 20D box is empty! ;) A real shopping window with a better sign would have improved the image a lot. 6.', '2005-03-15 15:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229729, 153726, 34705, '<td valign="top">I love this picture... It''s super! <br/>how he/she have made the idea for this? <br/>I love it !</td>', 'I love this picture... It''s super! how he/she have made the idea for this? I love it !', '2005-03-15 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229732, 153958, 27845, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that''s what I''m talking about. You did a good job creating an alternative version of your original image, so I don''t feel you just ''copied'' your old shot. This time I don''t like the background that much though. Is this the same place as for Surreal Vacuuming?<br/>Wait I just noticed...are you actually ironing the shirt you were wearing in your last shot? *grin*. Yeah, I think your 10 is well deserved. Good luck to you.</td>', 'Yeah, that''s what I''m talking about. You did a good job creating an alternative version of your original image, so I don''t feel you just ''copied'' your old shot. This time I don''t like the background that much though. Is this the same place as for Surreal Vacuuming?Wait I just noticed...are you actually ironing the shirt you were wearing in your last shot? *grin*. Yeah, I think your 10 is well deserved. Good luck to you.', '2005-03-15 15:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229742, 154020, 27845, '<td valign="top">Excellent setup. Is he hanging with his feet between the steps? The idea would have been stronger if the orange guy had been walking to the left, downstairs, uh, upstairs, well... you know what I mean. This is confusing. 9.</td>', 'Excellent setup. Is he hanging with his feet between the steps? The idea would have been stronger if the orange guy had been walking to the left, downstairs, uh, upstairs, well... you know what I mean. This is confusing. 9.', '2005-03-15 15:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
