(1229762, 152335, 27845, '<td valign="top">Looks great. Please tell me after voting is over how you did this, what light source you used. The motion looks really interesting. The choice of background is not so good. 9.</td>', 'Looks great. Please tell me after voting is over how you did this, what light source you used. The motion looks really interesting. The choice of background is not so good. 9.', '2005-03-15 15:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
