(1229775, 154133, 24512, '<td valign="top">Very surreal, crisp clean, nice glow around the bulb. very cool.  i guess if they have to be validated people are jealous thinking its too good.  I''m not jealous but i gave it a 10, good job.  I hope you tell how you did it after the voting.</td>', 'Very surreal, crisp clean, nice glow around the bulb. very cool.  i guess if they have to be validated people are jealous thinking its too good.  I''m not jealous but i gave it a 10, good job.  I hope you tell how you did it after the voting.', '2005-03-15 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
