(1229780, 154143, 3145, '<td valign="top">There is not really anything intersting in this photograph.  I realize your point is the angel, but there is not enough contrast between the little figurine and the rest of the picture; seems wanting.</td>', 'There is not really anything intersting in this photograph.  I realize your point is the angel, but there is not enough contrast between the little figurine and the rest of the picture; seems wanting.', '2005-03-15 16:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
