(1231492, 154112, 19670, '<td valign="top">Wow...thanks for all the positive comments! I really didn''t expect to place in the top 20--my highest ever! It was way cool to have people reference Dali, who is probably my favorite surrealist.<br/>I''m glad my wife suggested I incorporate part of her painting as a background. I wish I had brightened the image some, though.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-16 10:28:24.</i></td>', 'Wow...thanks for all the positive comments! I really didn''t expect to place in the top 20--my highest ever! It was way cool to have people reference Dali, who is probably my favorite surrealist.I''m glad my wife suggested I incorporate part of her painting as a background. I wish I had brightened the image some, though.', '2005-03-16 07:27:43.000000', '2005-03-16 10:28:24.000000', 0),
