(1232520, 153948, 5515, '<td valign="top">Hey Kiwi. 4th doesn''t suck. Pretty good in such a large field. It only sucks if those around you aren''t playing by the same rules.  <br/> <br/>If I would have known I could edit the hell out of an image, pull it up on a monitor and shoot it all within the rules I would have. For a ''no editing'' challenge there sure is a bunch of editing going on.  Sour grapes? Nah. This was all for fun. All I know is that I busted my butt to create an image that all I had to do was hit auto levels and away ya go. I did so, and I am proud of the image.  <br/> <br/>Like I said. My last one. Validation has been asked for and I won''t submit. I sincerely thank all those that have left comments and kind words. Every comment was read and appreciated...</td>', 'Hey Kiwi. 4th doesn''t suck. Pretty good in such a large field. It only sucks if those around you aren''t playing by the same rules.   If I would have known I could edit the hell out of an image, pull it up on a monitor and shoot it all within the rules I would have. For a ''no editing'' challenge there sure is a bunch of editing going on.  Sour grapes? Nah. This was all for fun. All I know is that I busted my butt to create an image that all I had to do was hit auto levels and away ya go. I did so, and I am proud of the image.   Like I said. My last one. Validation has been asked for and I won''t submit. I sincerely thank all those that have left comments and kind words. Every comment was read and appreciated...', '2005-03-16 14:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
