(1235435, 152990, 24805, '<td valign="top">thanks for the feedback folks. i guess there are a lot of different definitions of surreal out there. my working definition is, "something that doesn''t seem natural and ordinary." you can take that any number of ways: impossible, ultra-real, or (in my case), ethereal.</td>', 'thanks for the feedback folks. i guess there are a lot of different definitions of surreal out there. my working definition is, "something that doesn''t seem natural and ordinary." you can take that any number of ways: impossible, ultra-real, or (in my case), ethereal.', '2005-03-17 22:07:57.000000', NULL, 0),
