(1236645, 154133, 32094, '<td valign="top">I loved this picture and it diffently deserves the ribbon, but does it not mean there is a gap in the rules. I far as I was aware no photoshoping etc (apart from levels, curves etc.) is allowed. Could we all just manipulate all our images and take a photo of the screen on Basic Editing?<br/></td>', 'I loved this picture and it diffently deserves the ribbon, but does it not mean there is a gap in the rules. I far as I was aware no photoshoping etc (apart from levels, curves etc.) is allowed. Could we all just manipulate all our images and take a photo of the screen on Basic Editing?', '2005-03-18 18:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
