(1239188, 152335, 11254, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gloda:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks great. Please tell me after voting is over how you did this, what light source you used. The motion looks really interesting. The choice of background is not so good. 9. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Light source was a glow stick, as one of these comments figured out.I attached a glowstick  to a long broken rubber band so it would create motion. Background was regular street lights, but because of long exposure, it gave an interesting effect. Some comments made about distracting background- i was going for more the color play...but i still think it worked out fine.  SO great to be placed in top 20 guys!</td>', 'Originally posted by gloda: Looks great. Please tell me after voting is over how you did this, what light source you used. The motion looks really interesting. The choice of background is not so good. 9.   Light source was a glow stick, as one of these comments figured out.I attached a glowstick  to a long broken rubber band so it would create motion. Background was regular street lights, but because of long exposure, it gave an interesting effect. Some comments made about distracting background- i was going for more the color play...but i still think it worked out fine.  SO great to be placed in top 20 guys!', '2005-03-20 17:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
