(1992678, 153921, 34659, '<td valign="top">LOL - Love the setup!  The crop seems a bit tight on the top &amp; left, and the colors are a bit washed out, but you really got a great capture!  I would consider burning some areas to deepen the color tones, maybe increase the color sat, and sharpen just a hair.  Very cute shot!  Still wondering how in the world you managed to convince the little guys to perform for you!!!</td>', 'LOL - Love the setup!  The crop seems a bit tight on the top & left, and the colors are a bit washed out, but you really got a great capture!  I would consider burning some areas to deepen the color tones, maybe increase the color sat, and sharpen just a hair.  Very cute shot!  Still wondering how in the world you managed to convince the little guys to perform for you!!!', '2006-01-01 16:04:50.000000', NULL, 0),
