(2518880, 154112, 28710, '<td valign="top">Hey dude, have you tried to use the pillowcase as a large diffuser?<br/> <br/>Try this:<br/> <br/>Get a big clear bag (suitable for the size of the pillowcase), inflate with air and tie off.<br/> <br/>Place it inside the pillowcase with the tie on the side so the light can enter unobstruted, but the light that exits forwards also doesn''t get affected..<br/> <br/>This should make the light source even larger and softer.<br/> <br/>and weaker of course :)<br/> <br/>good creativity!</td>', 'Hey dude, have you tried to use the pillowcase as a large diffuser? Try this: Get a big clear bag (suitable for the size of the pillowcase), inflate with air and tie off. Place it inside the pillowcase with the tie on the side so the light can enter unobstruted, but the light that exits forwards also doesn''t get affected.. This should make the light source even larger and softer. and weaker of course :) good creativity!', '2006-06-15 01:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
