(4012252, 154133, 41098, '<td valign="top">I''ve always loved your work and I''m flattered you stopped by my site to comment - THANK YOU. Your work has taught me that "those great photos" are all in the mind of the photographer. Though I would never think I was capable of such a great photo (like this one) your explanations make me a bit closer to the "dream" if you will. You put masterpieces in reach. Thanks for showing your work!</td>', 'I''ve always loved your work and I''m flattered you stopped by my site to comment - THANK YOU. Your work has taught me that "those great photos" are all in the mind of the photographer. Though I would never think I was capable of such a great photo (like this one) your explanations make me a bit closer to the "dream" if you will. You put masterpieces in reach. Thanks for showing your work!', '2007-08-19 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 0),
